(11, 1, 'Joshua Tree', 'The strangest trees, the best rocks, what&#8217;s not to love?', 153, '2011-01-19 01:00:00', '2011-03-11 20:54:50'),
(12, 1, 'The Salton Sea', 'A stagnant lake full of dead fish... no wait that makes it sound bad', 198, '2011-01-19 00:00:00', '2011-03-11 20:57:55'),
(13, 1, 'Tiny Church', 'The sign says &#8220;Pause, Rest, Worship&#8221;... so we did', 205, '2011-01-23 00:00:00', '2011-03-11 21:00:13'),
(14, 1, 'Scott & Co', 'A New York style bar in a place about as far away from New York as you can get.', 335, '2011-01-27 00:00:00', '2011-03-27 09:42:48'),
(15, 2, 'Prince of Tucson RV Park', 'Where we stayed Tucson, but you should probably stay in a State Park, or something.', 136, '2011-01-25 00:00:00', '2011-03-30 20:54:55'),
