(48, 1, 'New Orleans Bars', 'How to drink well in a sea of bad drinks.', 229, '2011-03-16 00:00:00', '2011-07-12 22:42:01'),
(49, 1, 'The Gravity Monument', 'Gravity - Our Enemy Number One', 241, '2011-04-16 00:00:00', '2011-07-18 18:58:34'),
(50, 2, 'International Towing and Recovery Hall of Fame and Museum', 'The fascinating world of tow trucks... in museum form!', 222, '2011-04-22 00:00:00', '2011-07-25 22:27:33'),
(51, 1, 'Bar 308', 'The ultimate local bar', 306, '2011-05-03 00:00:00', '2011-08-01 17:53:34'),
(52, 2, 'Elvis Presley''s Graceland', 'Where Alana remembered that Elvis was actually totally hot.', 607, '2011-04-28 00:00:00', '2011-08-03 13:20:32'),
(53, 2, 'Ft Sumter', 'Our second Civil War fort, but this one is less of a Spring Break vacation destination.', 106, '2011-10-13 00:00:00', '2011-10-13 15:21:05'),
(54, 2, 'Prairie Dog Town', 'The best 50 cents we spent all year. According to Alana.', 122, '2011-10-18 00:00:00', '2011-10-18 14:03:42');
