(281, 1, '70', 'Disney Greenhouse', 'A very Star Trek: The Next Generation style building. Really most of EPCOT was very TNG. Simultaneously exciting and kind of depressing that that was the high water mark for futurism.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/281_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/281_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/281_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 120, '2011-05-19 20:21:35'),
(282, 2, '77', 'Castillo Cannons', 'At the Castillo De San Marcos in St. Augustine Florida.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/282_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/282_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/282_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 43, '2011-05-27 10:31:37'),
(283, 2, '77', 'Castillo Interior', 'The layout inside changed depending on who was in possession of the fort, the current interior is mostly left over from the British era.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/283_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/283_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/283_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 42, '2011-05-27 10:34:52'),
(284, 2, '78', 'Fountain of Youth', 'Not sure this place is kitschy enough to warrant the admission, but at least there was this guy. We did drink the water, so maybe it''ll be worth it in 10 years when we look the same.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/284_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/284_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/284_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 53, '2011-05-27 10:38:09'),
(285, 2, '79', 'BBQ pig', 'It wouldn''t be a barbeque restaurant unless there was a large sign or statue of a pig nearby. This guy is outside Smokin'' D''s in St. Augustine, Florida.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/285_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/285_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/285_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1365', 1, 200, '2011-05-27 10:42:34'),
(286, 2, '80', 'Confederate', 'Bonaventure Cemetery in Savannah was half of what I expected, lots of moss, Confederate flags, tourists, but it was also a lot smaller and newer than I was expecting. Every grave that had a Confederate vet was covered in flags.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/286_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/286_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/286_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 49, '2011-05-27 10:47:54'),
(287, 2, '80', 'Bonaventure Angel', 'One in a long series of Victorian era angels that i''ve taken a picture of. This one is in Savannah Georgia.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/287_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/287_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/287_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 70, '2011-05-27 10:51:20'),
(288, 2, '80', 'Bonaventure Cemetery', 'These flowers were the brightest pink. They made a nice contrast to the Spanish moss.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/288_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/288_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/288_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 52, '2011-05-27 10:53:05'),
(289, 2, '43', 'Weather Warnings and Watches', 'For April 27th, 2011. The red lines are tornado warnings,\r\nthe yellow are for severe thunderstorms and the green ones are for flood warnings. yikes!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/289_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/289_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/289_2_600.jpg', '1024', '690', 1, 71, '2011-05-27 10:57:14'),
(290, 2, '81', 'Flooding', 'This is the day after the big tornado that hit Alabama. We saw a lot of flooding in Tennessee, but this was the only bit we actually had to drive through.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/290_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/290_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/290_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 70, '2011-05-27 11:00:54'),
(291, 2, '82', 'Grave jail?', 'Not sure what the deal is with this. There were definitely body snatchers in the 1800''s, but this doesn''t look like a sturdy enough deterrent. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/291_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/291_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/291_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 48, '2011-05-27 11:04:38'),
(292, 2, '83', 'Old Timey Bicycles', 'Sadly I did not see anyone in Savannah riding one of these.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/292_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/292_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/292_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 62, '2011-05-27 11:06:13'),
(293, 2, '84', 'Mile and a Half Oak Alley', 'At Wormsloe Plantation outside Savannah, GA. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/293_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/293_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/293_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 58, '2011-06-07 13:05:12'),
(294, 2, '85', 'Husk', 'The first bar we visited on our trip to Charleston. They make barrel aged cocktails, and the Southern issue of Imbibe had no fewer than 6 pictures of this bar in it. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/294_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/294_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/294_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 62, '2011-06-07 13:13:06'),
(295, 2, '86', 'Fort Sumter', 'We visited the week of the 150th anniversary of the start of the Civil War, which happened at Fort Sumter. It''s one of those places that it''s cool to be able to say you''ve visited, but you have an hour to fill until the ferry takes you back, and to be honest, you don''t need half that much time. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/295_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/295_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/295_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 50, '2011-06-07 13:29:36'),
(296, 2, '87', 'Confederate Graves', 'Every Confederate grave has been located and covered with stuff by some organization, but these are the graves of the crew of the H.L. Hunley, the Confederate submarine that sunk a Union ship in Charleston harbor, and then disappeared until being located offshore in the 1990''s.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/296_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/296_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/296_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 56, '2011-06-07 13:34:39'),
(297, 2, '87', 'Magnolia Cemetery', 'In Charleston, South Carolina. The South sure does know how to make a good Cemetery. The combination of money, age and spanish moss equal almost unlimited photo opportunities. Plus there''s an actual element of danger, as all of them seem to be near swamps with Caution Alligators! signs nearby.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/297_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/297_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/297_2_600.jpg', '1024', '718', 1, 49, '2011-06-07 13:44:21'),
(298, 2, '87', 'Headless', 'Magnolia Cemetery has a lot of statues with missing limbs, but this one looks like it''s head is in the urn. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/298_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/298_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/298_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 48, '2011-06-07 13:51:26'),
(299, 2, '88', 'Fried Green Tomato BLT', 'At Hominy Grill in Charleston. Paul had something called the Big Nasty Biscuit, which was a biscuit, gravy, fried chicken and cheddar cheese. Both were amazing. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/299_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/299_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/299_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 66, '2011-06-07 13:57:03'),
(300, 2, '89', 'Carriage Tour', 'We were walking slow enough taking pictures on the sidewalk that we kept hearing long bits of multiple tours going by, so we kind of got a free tour. And also some exercise.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/300_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/300_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/300_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 48, '2011-06-07 14:01:18'),
(301, 2, '89', 'Carolopolis', 'A familiar sight on many of the old houses in Charleston, of which almost all are pre CivIl War.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/301_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/301_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/301_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 59, '2011-06-07 14:10:04'),
(302, 2, '90', 'Mr. Pig', 'You know you''re in the South when your local supermarket is a Piggly Wiggly.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/302_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/302_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/302_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 49, '2011-06-07 14:15:46'),
(303, 2, '91', 'For Gone With the Wind fans', 'Margaret Mitchell''s grave at Oakland Cemetery in Atlanta.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/303_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/303_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/303_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 74, '2011-06-07 14:33:35'),
(304, 2, '93', 'Confederate Lion', 'A monument to fallen Confederate soldiers at Oakland Cemetery in Atlanta, GA.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/304_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/304_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/304_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 70, '2011-06-24 10:05:02'),
(305, 2, '94', 'Stone Mountain', 'The Confederate Mount Rushmore, plus theme park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/305_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/305_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/305_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 33, '2011-06-24 10:09:06'),
(306, 2, '94', 'Top of Stone Mountain', 'There''s an excellent view of the whole Atlanta area from up there.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/306_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/306_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/306_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 63, '2011-06-24 10:11:31'),
(307, 2, '95', 'Community BBQ', 'Some of the best bbq chicken we''ve had on this trip, plus excellent cowboy beans.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/307_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/307_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/307_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 37, '2011-06-24 10:14:58'),
(308, 2, '96', 'Late night visit to Krispy Kreme', 'Conveyor belt of deliciousness, in Atlanta, GA.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/308_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/308_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/308_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 50, '2011-06-24 10:22:23'),
(309, 2, '97', 'Mountain Dog', 'Gretchen takes in the view from Black Rock Mountain State park in Georgia.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/309_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/309_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/309_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 27, '2011-06-24 10:30:39'),
(310, 2, '97', 'Following', 'What other cars see, when they get stuck behind us.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/310_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/310_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/310_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 48, '2011-06-24 10:38:11'),
(311, 1, '98', 'The Holy Family Shrine', 'An incredible Catholic church on the hill above the freeway in Nebraska', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/311_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/311_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/311_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 61, '2011-06-24 21:58:39'),
(312, 1, '98', 'The Roadside Shrine', 'Up close at the Holy Family Shrine on the side of interstate 80 in nebraska', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/312_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/312_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/312_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-06-24 22:05:18'),
(313, 1, '98', 'Shrine Waterway', 'The water comes from inside the shrine, up underneath the pulpit and runs under the pews and out the door through this little waterway.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/313_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/313_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/313_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1024', 1, 33, '2011-06-24 22:08:42'),
(314, 1, '98', 'The Main Entrance', 'This is how you get into the shrine, through a subterranean administrative area.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/314_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/314_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/314_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 32, '2011-06-24 22:14:14'),
(315, 1, '98', 'Shine and the Highway', 'From the rest stop across the interstate you can see the shrine as you drive by.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/315_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/315_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/315_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 45, '2011-06-24 22:16:05'),
(316, 1, '99', 'Carlsbad Stalagmite', 'One of a near infinite number of formations that i can''t remember the name of.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/316_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/316_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/316_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 42, '2011-06-24 22:29:47'),
(317, 1, '99', 'The Subterranean Lunchroom', 'You can eat a sandwich 750 feet underground!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/317_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/317_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/317_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 30, '2011-06-24 22:45:35'),
(318, 1, '99', 'Almost Columns', 'Stalactites and stalagmites almost touching.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/318_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/318_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/318_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 39, '2011-06-24 22:50:08'),
(319, 1, '99', 'Drapery', 'These strange formations are called drapery because they look sort of like curtains', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/319_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/319_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/319_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 27, '2011-06-26 12:59:00'),
(320, 1, '99', 'The Rock of Ages', 'This is still an active formation with a pool at the bottom of it full of the water dribbling off of it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/320_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/320_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/320_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1536', 1, 37, '2011-06-26 13:06:17'),
(321, 1, '76', 'Tennessee Whiskey and Ginger Ale', 'Tennessee whiskey is a little drier than bourbons so it doesn''t sweeten up the mixture too much. The best combo we found was 2 oz. George Dickel mixed with about 4 oz. Ale 8 One ginger ale from Kentucky.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/321_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/321_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/321_1_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 58, '2011-06-27 21:30:40'),
(322, 1, '100', 'Variety of Southern "Food"', 'Some of our regional favorites from the south.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/322_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/322_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/322_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 51, '2011-06-27 21:37:15'),
(323, 1, '84', 'Wormsloe Plantation Gate', 'The gate leading into the outrageously long tree lined drive.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/323_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/323_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/323_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 72, '2011-06-27 21:46:42'),
(324, 1, '84', 'Boulevard', 'The 1 and a half mile long tree lined drive at Wormsloe Plantation in Savannah', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/324_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/324_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/324_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 46, '2011-06-27 22:00:25'),
(325, 1, '84', 'Tabby Ruins', 'The oldest structure in Savannah', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/325_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/325_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/325_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 64, '2011-06-27 22:02:24'),
(326, 1, '101', 'Love Garden Haul', 'Part of a huge haul of records from the amazing Love Garden Vinyl in Lawrence, KS. All of these records are in VG+ or Near Mint and were all $5 or less.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/326_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/326_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/326_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1024', 1, 33, '2011-06-27 22:11:39'),
(327, 1, '102', 'Demanding Donkey', 'One of the pack of wild burros that roam around this part of Custer State Park. Burros want food!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/327_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/327_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/327_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 42, '2011-06-27 22:22:28'),
(328, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake', 'Technically part of Custer State Park, this lake stands out from the rest of the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/328_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/328_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/328_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 40, '2011-06-27 22:25:25'),
(329, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake', 'Technically part of Custer State Park, this lake stands out from the rest of the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/329_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/329_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/329_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 24, '2011-06-27 22:26:12'),
(330, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake', 'Technically part of Custer State Park, this lake stands out from the rest of the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/330_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/330_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/330_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 31, '2011-06-27 22:26:50'),
(331, 1, '103', 'The Eye of the Needle', 'A tiny arch on the needles highway just past Sylvan Lake', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/331_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/331_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/331_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1536', 1, 90, '2011-06-27 22:28:19'),
(332, 1, '103', 'The Pinnacles', 'Along the Needles Highway just past Sylvan Lake in Custer State Park', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/332_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/332_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/332_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-06-27 22:29:20'),
(333, 1, '102', 'Lone Burro', 'A wild burro outstanding in his field.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/333_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/333_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/333_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 35, '2011-06-27 22:33:54'),
(334, 1, '102', 'Bison', 'A Bison helping some birds have a place to sit.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/334_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/334_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/334_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 42, '2011-06-27 22:35:17'),
(335, 1, '102', 'Huge Bison Herd', 'Custer State Park has a herd of about 1500 bison from which they cull 300 every year to help start new herds elsewhere. It is an amazing sight to see so many in one place.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/335_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/335_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/335_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 61, '2011-06-27 22:36:35'),
(336, 1, '102', 'Bison', 'One of the herd of 1500 in the park', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/336_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/336_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/336_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1024', 1, 35, '2011-06-27 22:37:51'),
(337, 1, '104', 'Crazy Horse Monument', 'The insanely ambitious monument commemorating the Lakota Sioux leader Crazy Horse. Eventually that huge outcropping will be his horse and pointing finger.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/337_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/337_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/337_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-06-27 23:04:04'),
(338, 1, '105', 'The Approach', 'Coming up on mt rushmore you get a nice prospect that isn''t the shot everyone has seen.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/338_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/338_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/338_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 34, '2011-06-28 09:21:25'),
(339, 1, '105', 'Stonefaced', 'The shot that everyone has seen from the visitors balcony. You really get a sense of the insane scale and attention to detail here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/339_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/339_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/339_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 47, '2011-06-28 09:23:42'),
(340, 1, '105', 'The Mountain', 'Showing a little more detail of the rock it is carved from.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/340_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/340_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/340_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 44, '2011-06-28 09:26:09'),
(341, 1, '105', 'Presidents Noses', 'there is a trail that leads up to the debris pile where you can look up their noses.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/341_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/341_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/341_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-06-28 09:27:32'),
(342, 1, '105', 'George', 'A nice profile of the man.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/342_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/342_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/342_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 39, '2011-06-28 09:28:29'),
(343, 1, '105', 'Framed Rushmore', 'Shot from the avenue of the flags. This leads to the main viewing platform.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/343_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/343_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/343_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 46, '2011-06-28 09:29:28'),
(344, 1, '106', 'The Milky Way Over Devils Tower', 'Spent a few hours chasing the Milky Way with a few other photographers out in the middle of nowhere last night. Strangely after a while I found out i already knew one of the guys. What are the chances to meet someone you know in a random field in an isolated corner of an empty state at midnight.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/344_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/344_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/344_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 152, '2011-06-29 08:10:00');
INSERT INTO `photos` (`id`, `user_id`, `place_id`, `title`, `caption`, `url`, `thumbnail`, `med`, `width`, `height`, `active`, `views`, `created`) VALUES
(345, 1, '107', 'Minuteman II Nuclear Missile', 'The business end of a Minuteman II nuclear missile. This is shot looking down through a glass enclosure on the original site right by the freeway.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/345_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/345_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/345_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 72, '2011-07-04 13:42:46'),
(346, 1, '107', 'Plastic Carpet at Minuteman Missile Base', 'These military carpet things are always great, i wish i had room to collect them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/346_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/346_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/346_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1317', 1, 51, '2011-07-04 13:44:38'),
(347, 1, '107', 'Silo Cover', 'This glass canopy covers the missile and protects it from the weather (and you)', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/347_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/347_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/347_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 52, '2011-07-04 13:46:07'),
(348, 1, '107', 'Peacekeeper Armored Truck', 'The top side support staff of the missile base used these behemoths to run security checks to the distributed silos.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/348_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/348_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/348_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 62, '2011-07-04 13:48:18'),
(349, 1, '107', 'Longwave Antenna', 'This antenna allowed plane known as Looking Glass to remotely issue launch commands in case Washington was unable to. Looking Glass is an airborne command center  that is in the air 24 hours a day meant to mirror the government in case the government is disrupted.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/349_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/349_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/349_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 49, '2011-07-04 13:52:52'),
(350, 1, '107', 'The Lounge at the End of the World', 'I love the surreality of this shot. The TV room for the topside crew and support staff at the Minuteman launch facility. The serene forest wallpaper must have really put everyones mind at ease.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/350_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/350_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/350_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 55, '2011-07-04 13:58:28'),
(351, 1, '107', '30 Minutes or the Next One''s Free', 'The command capsules 20 ton blast door. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/351_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/351_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/351_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 90, '2011-07-04 14:02:35'),
(352, 1, '107', 'Inner Shell of the Capsule', 'The Minuteman II capsule had a hardened outer shell and then a super shock absorbed inner capsule that could absorb the shock of a near miss. This is the bridge between the blast door and the inner capsule.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/352_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/352_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/352_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 39, '2011-07-04 14:19:08'),
(353, 1, '107', 'Microwave of Doom!', 'The microwave down in the launch capsule, used to reheat coffee while waiting for the end of the world.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/353_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/353_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/353_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-07-04 14:22:51'),
(354, 1, '107', 'Minuteman Launch Control Panel', 'One of the control panels at the Status Console ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/354_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/354_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/354_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1536', 1, 63, '2011-07-04 14:26:02'),
(355, 1, '107', 'Minuteman II Lauch Capsule', 'The capsule had a crew of 3, one at the status console in the middle, one at the command console in the back and another in the bunk in the middle for relief.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/355_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/355_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/355_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 50, '2011-07-04 14:28:06'),
(356, 1, '107', 'No Lone Zone', 'The inside of the blast door leading into the launch capsule', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/356_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/356_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/356_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 55, '2011-07-04 14:29:18'),
(357, 1, '108', 'Astropop Rocks', 'A multicolored section of the Badlands', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/357_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/357_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/357_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 35, '2011-07-04 14:37:41'),
(358, 1, '108', 'Red Yellow Green Blue', 'Almost a full spectrum of light here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/358_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/358_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/358_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 30, '2011-07-04 14:43:26'),
(359, 1, '108', 'Badlands', 'More insane colors', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/359_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/359_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/359_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 34, '2011-07-04 14:44:35'),
(360, 1, '108', 'Desert with Grass', 'So strange to see what seems like a desert environment but with the prairie just seeping into it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/360_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/360_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/360_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-07-04 14:46:25'),
(361, 1, '108', 'Spine', 'A ridge of multicolored striations at Badlands', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/361_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/361_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/361_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 45, '2011-07-04 14:47:25'),
(362, 1, '108', 'Moonscape', 'Craggy landscape of Badlands National Park', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/362_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/362_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/362_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-07-04 15:06:55'),
(363, 1, '108', 'Badlands Mesas', 'Flat tops at Badlands', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/363_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/363_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/363_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 28, '2011-07-04 15:08:28'),
(364, 1, '108', 'Ridge', 'Another amazing bit of spectrum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/364_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/364_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/364_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 38, '2011-07-04 15:10:31'),
(365, 1, '108', 'Greetings From Mars', 'So much alien landscape for being in South Dakota', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/365_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/365_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/365_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-07-04 15:11:46'),
(366, 1, '108', 'Brown', 'At Badlands', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/366_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/366_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/366_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 40, '2011-07-04 15:30:50'),
(367, 1, '108', 'Pockmarked Prairie', 'Looking down on the pockmarked prairie from the top of  a ridge at sunset.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/367_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/367_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/367_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 25, '2011-07-04 15:32:26'),
(368, 1, '108', 'Striations', 'A pousse cafe ridge at badlands', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/368_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/368_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/368_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 28, '2011-07-04 15:33:55'),
(369, 1, '108', 'Layers', 'The sun brings out the most amazing colors here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/369_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/369_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/369_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 35, '2011-07-04 15:34:44'),
(370, 1, '108', 'Roadside Badlands', 'A sunlit ridge from the side of the road.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/370_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/370_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/370_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 32, '2011-07-04 15:35:55'),
(371, 1, '108', 'Badlands Teepee', 'A teepee at our campground at the badlands.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/371_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/371_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/371_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 33, '2011-07-04 15:36:51'),
(372, 1, '109', 'Prehistoric Mammoth Bone Shelter', 'A shelter made from mammoth jawbones. Pretty comfortable for an ossuary.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/372_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/372_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/372_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 45, '2011-07-04 15:40:34'),
(373, 1, '109', 'Mammoth Sinkhole', 'A huge sinkhole that captured hundreds of of Columbian and Woolly Mammoths preserving and fossilizing their skeletons. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/373_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/373_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/373_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 76, '2011-07-04 15:43:36'),
(374, 1, '109', 'Mammoth Skull', 'A complete skull. It even kinda looks like a cartoon mammoth with a little tuft of hair on top.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/374_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/374_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/374_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 36, '2011-07-04 15:44:52'),
(375, 1, '109', 'Mammoth Footprints', 'The arrows point to where Mammoths walked over the drying mud in the sinkhole in the summer.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/375_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/375_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/375_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 36, '2011-07-04 15:46:12'),
(376, 1, '109', 'Mammoth Tusks', 'Fossilized Mammoth tusks at the incredible Mammoth site, a collection of 70 odd mammoth skeletons in an air conditioned building.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/376_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/376_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/376_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 34, '2011-07-04 15:48:14'),
(377, 1, '110', 'The Coldest Penguin in America', 'Supposedly Cut Bank Montana is the coldest place in the nation. Though it seems like Alaska might get colder, perhaps it is windier here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/377_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/377_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/377_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 65, '2011-07-04 15:50:56'),
(378, 1, '111', 'GMC after the Storm', 'After one of the many insane thunderstorms we experienced in South Dakota', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/378_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/378_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/378_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 45, '2011-07-04 15:53:35'),
(379, 1, '112', 'Cheyenne Markers', 'Makers where Cheyenne warriors fell at the Battle of Little Bighorn during Custer''s Last Stand', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/379_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/379_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/379_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 47, '2011-07-04 16:00:38'),
(380, 1, '112', 'Native Warrior Monument', 'The battlefield is very neutral in representing the native half of the battle as well as the cavalry half of the battle. This is the native warrior monument showing the cavalry monument up on the hill above.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/380_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/380_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/380_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 35, '2011-07-04 16:04:53'),
(381, 1, '112', 'Warrior Sculpture', 'A sculpture that is part of the Native Warrior monument.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/381_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/381_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/381_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 49, '2011-07-04 16:05:49'),
(382, 1, '112', 'Cavalry Monument', 'This marks where most of the Cavalrymen are buried on last stand hill. They fell about 20 feet away and are interred here. Custer and the other officers were removed and reinterred in various other cemeteries elsewhere. Custer is at West Point.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/382_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/382_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/382_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 38, '2011-07-04 16:08:50'),
(383, 1, '112', 'Where Custer Fell', 'These markers show where each cavalryman fell on Last Stand Hill. The one with the backface is Custer.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/383_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/383_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/383_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 48, '2011-07-04 16:10:08'),
(384, 1, '112', 'An Unknown Soldier', 'A marker where an unknown cavalryman fell.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/384_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/384_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/384_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 42, '2011-07-04 16:11:43'),
(385, 1, '112', 'The Battlefield', 'The mustard filled Little Bighorn Battlefield with a storm coming in.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/385_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/385_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/385_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 33, '2011-07-04 16:13:00'),
(386, 1, '112', 'End of a Cavalryman', 'A lonely marker overlooking where Sitting Bull was camped.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/386_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/386_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/386_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 35, '2011-07-04 16:14:27'),
(387, 1, '112', 'Sioux Marker', 'A marker where a Sans Arc Sioux fell during the battle of little bighorn.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/387_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/387_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/387_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 49, '2011-07-04 16:19:16'),
(388, 1, '112', 'Now That''s What I Call Native American!', 'A comedy choice of color at the trading post outside of Little Bighorn National Battlefield.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/388_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/388_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/388_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 44, '2011-07-04 16:20:55'),
(389, 1, '113', 'The Roundup', 'A Charlie Russell bronze sculpture in the lobby of the CW Russell Museum', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/389_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/389_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/389_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 63, '2011-07-04 16:24:59'),
(390, 1, '113', 'Headdress Exhibit', 'I hadn''t ever seen a good collection of headdresses together like this. Obviously they had a pretty fascinating craftsmanship to them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/390_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/390_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/390_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-07-04 16:26:30'),
(391, 1, '113', 'One of the Russell Galleries', 'I think there were 7 galleries most of which where of his work.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/391_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/391_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/391_1_600.jpg', '1024', '431', 1, 50, '2011-07-04 16:27:36'),
(392, 1, '113', 'Charlie Russell''s Studio', 'In 1903 he built a log studio where he would do all of his painting and sculpting.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/392_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/392_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/392_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 56, '2011-07-04 16:28:53'),
(393, 1, '113', 'Buffalo Skull', 'Charlie Russell''s signature had the buffalo skull in it and much of his work featured a skull in it somewhere. He was a big part of establishing the buffalo as a western icon.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/393_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/393_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/393_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 49, '2011-07-04 16:30:38'),
(394, 1, '113', 'Charlie Russell''s Studio Interior', 'The inside of the log studio. The high ceilings and skylights made this an exceedingly nice place to be.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/394_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/394_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/394_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 63, '2011-07-04 16:32:04'),
(395, 1, '114', 'Wall Drug', 'After seeing signs for hundreds of miles, Alana had to go.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/395_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/395_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/395_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 64, '2011-07-04 16:47:33'),
(396, 1, '114', 'Inside Wall Drug', 'It used to be a drug store, but now it is a giant sort of charming gift shop. The book store is actually pretty good though.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/396_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/396_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/396_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 56, '2011-07-04 16:48:50'),
(397, 1, '114', 'Alana on a Jackalope', 'In the backyard area of Wall Drug is a giant Jackalope that you can climb up on. Had to wait in line with a bunch of kids to get up on it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/397_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/397_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/397_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1024', 1, 88, '2011-07-04 16:50:18'),
(398, 1, '114', 'Free ice water', 'All of the signs along the highway promote the free ice water available at wall drug. Here you go.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/398_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/398_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/398_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 78, '2011-07-04 16:51:53'),
(399, 1, '115', 'Central Grocery Muffuletta', 'One of the great sandwiches of the world. A perfect balance of salami, ham, mortadella, provolone, olive salad on a muffuletta roll with the requisite Barq''s root beer in a bottle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/399_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/399_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/399_1_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 66, '2011-07-10 12:11:38'),
(400, 1, '116', 'The Carousel Bar', 'The slowly rotating bar at Hotel Monteleone. it takes about an hour to make a full revolution. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/400_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/400_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/400_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 73, '2011-07-12 22:29:05'),
(401, 1, '117', 'Cure', 'The bar at Cure. For craft cocktails, this was our favorite in new orleans.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/401_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/401_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/401_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 121, '2011-07-12 22:32:14'),
(402, 1, '118', 'The Sazerac Bar', 'A Sazerac and a Ramos Gin Fizz at the superb Sazerac Bar at the Roosevelt Hotel in New Orleans.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/402_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/402_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/402_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 71, '2011-07-12 22:35:26'),
(403, 1, '121', 'The Emory Gravity Monument', 'The exceptionally awesomely, weird monument extolling the virtues of controlling gravity at Emory university.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/403_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/403_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/403_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 64, '2011-07-18 18:54:16'),
(404, 1, '122', 'Towing and Recovery Hall of Fame', 'A few of the two trucks at one of the oddest and best museums we have visited on this trip. A museum of tow trucks', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/404_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/404_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/404_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 89, '2011-07-25 21:57:17'),
(405, 1, '122', 'Early Tow Truck', 'One of the earliest tow trucks at the museum of towing and recovery', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/405_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/405_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/405_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 87, '2011-07-25 21:58:31'),
(406, 1, '122', 'A GMC Bubble Nose Tow Truck', 'A tow truck with a great face at the towing museum', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/406_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/406_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/406_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 127, '2011-07-25 22:00:01'),
(407, 1, '122', 'World''s Largest Tow Truck', 'Or so the plaque claimed. It was extraordinarily large. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/407_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/407_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/407_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 216, '2011-07-25 22:01:57'),
(408, 1, '122', 'The World''s Smallest Tow Truck', 'It didn''t actually say, but it''s hard to believe that there are any smaller ones. This was used as a promo for a towing company but i think that it was able to tow a small economy car at one point.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/408_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/408_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/408_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 140, '2011-07-25 22:04:41'),
(409, 1, '122', 'Repo Man''s Cadillac Tow Truck', 'This was a Cadillac Sedan de Ville that had been converted into a Cadillac-amino and then fitted with towing gear to be used in repossessing other cars. Apparently he used it for years in regular repossession duty. Seems very subtle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/409_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/409_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/409_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 180, '2011-07-25 22:07:06'),
(410, 1, '122', 'Tow Truck Drivers Hall of Fame', 'A giant wall with hundreds of tow truck drivers photos. This was an incredible journey through some excellent hair styles.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/410_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/410_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/410_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 148, '2011-07-25 22:08:29'),
(411, 1, '122', 'The Towing Monument', 'An awesome sculpture of a shirtless tow truck driver saving a person and child from a sinking car out in front of the towing and recovery museum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/411_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/411_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/411_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 74, '2011-07-25 22:09:45'),
(412, 1, '123', 'Boxwork', 'This intricate formation comes from more resilient minerals seeping into cracks in the limestone. Eventually the limestone erodes and all that is left is the cracks.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/412_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/412_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/412_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 34, '2011-07-27 23:42:30'),
(413, 1, '123', 'Boxwork', 'More of the boxwork at wind cave. supposedly 95% of all of the boxwork in the world is in this cave system. It is very rare.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/413_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/413_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/413_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 36, '2011-07-27 23:45:01'),
(414, 1, '123', 'Wind Cave', 'Wind Cave is known for its extremely rare formations, ranging from boxwork to popcorn. Sometimes the air blowing out of the cave can rush up to 75mph.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/414_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/414_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/414_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 24, '2011-07-27 23:46:39'),
(415, 1, '123', 'Wind Cave Formations', 'Wind Cave is almost entirely dry but there are some amazing range of colors in here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/415_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/415_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/415_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 37, '2011-07-27 23:48:08'),
(416, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower', 'This meadow is one of the best places to get a good view of the tower. Everywhere else is right underneath it or too far away.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/416_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/416_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/416_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 26, '2011-07-27 23:50:24'),
(417, 1, '106', 'This Means Something, This is Important', 'Perhaps the most heard phrase while at devils tower.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/417_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/417_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/417_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-07-27 23:51:29'),
(418, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower', 'There are few more strange sights than a giant post like this in the middle of nowhere. It just bursts up from the ground and is visible for many miles in every direction', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/418_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/418_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/418_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 27, '2011-07-27 23:54:15'),
(419, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower', 'There is a great loop trail that goes all the way around the base of the tower with good views up close.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/419_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/419_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/419_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 27, '2011-07-27 23:55:11'),
(420, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower and Scree', 'Legend has it that 7 little girls fled a giant bear to the top of devils tower and the angry bear scratched up the side of the tower trying to get them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/420_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/420_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/420_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-07-27 23:56:15'),
(421, 1, '124', 'Bar 308', 'One of our favorite bars on this trip. Brandon and Ben behind the stick making everyone feel at home.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/421_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/421_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/421_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 66, '2011-07-28 00:01:49'),
(422, 1, '124', 'Bar 308', 'Named for the room in which the owners got engaged at the ace hotel, 308 is one of our favorite bars from this trip.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/422_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/422_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/422_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 81, '2011-07-28 00:03:01'),
(423, 1, '125', 'Seth Bullock''s Grave', 'The final resting place of Deadwood''s first Sheriff. He is at the very top of Mt Moriah cemetery and was placed there so that he could see the Teddy Roosevelt monument high on the other side of the valley (he was a friend of Roosevelt).', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/423_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/423_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/423_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 158, '2011-07-28 00:06:39'),
(424, 1, '125', 'Wild Bill Hickok''s Grave', 'After being gunned down in the old number 10 salon by Jack McCall, Hickok was laid to rest in Mt Moriah Cemetery. At the base of his grave are piles of playing cards.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/424_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/424_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/424_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-07-28 00:09:43'),
(425, 1, '125', 'Calamity Jane''s Grave', 'Right next to Wild Bill''s Grave, Calamity Jane has a pretty tasteful plot.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/425_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/425_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/425_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 60, '2011-07-28 00:11:00'),
(426, 1, '126', 'The Bullock Hotel', 'The hotel founded by Seth Bullock that is still in operation.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/426_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/426_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/426_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 62, '2011-07-28 00:13:15'),
(427, 1, '127', 'Original Saloon No. 10', 'The site of where Wild Bill was shot. The bar has since moved up the street though it doesn''t really bear any resemblance historically, other than some set pieces.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/427_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/427_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/427_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 46, '2011-07-28 00:18:54'),
(428, 1, '128', 'The Homestake Mine', 'George Hearst''s Homestake mine pit. This is an enormous hole in the ground. It yeilded over 40 million ounces of gold until it was shut in 2002. it is now being used by the national science foundation to study neutrinos and dark matter using it''s incredible depth to get far from background radiation.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/428_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/428_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/428_1_600.jpg', '1024', '499', 1, 50, '2011-07-28 00:25:09'),
(429, 1, '129', 'Elvis'' Living Room', 'The livingroom at Graceland', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/429_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/429_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/429_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 88, '2011-08-02 17:23:12'),
(430, 1, '129', 'Private Graceland', 'The upstairs is where Elvis lived (and died) and is not included on the tour. Supposedly not even the entourage was allowed upstairs.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/430_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/430_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/430_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 108, '2011-08-02 17:24:32'),
(431, 1, '129', 'The Dining Room', 'The main dining room always set and ready to go.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/431_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/431_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/431_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 65, '2011-08-02 17:30:38'),
(432, 1, '129', 'The Kitchen', 'Home of Peanut Butter and Banana Sandwiches', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/432_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/432_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/432_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 72, '2011-08-02 17:32:17'),
(433, 1, '129', 'TV Room Bar', 'The TV room is maybe the most famous part of Graceland but the bar in there is awesome.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/433_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/433_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/433_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 69, '2011-08-02 17:33:24'),
(434, 1, '129', 'The TV Lounge', 'Everyone has seen photos of Elvis'' TV wall before but this is the room that they are in. I love that it has the taking care of business in a flash logo on the wall.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/434_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/434_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/434_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 95, '2011-08-02 17:34:47'),
(435, 1, '129', 'The Pool Room', 'This room is awesome. There must be a thousand yards of fabric on the walls in here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/435_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/435_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/435_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 83, '2011-08-02 17:42:42'),
(436, 1, '129', 'The Jungle Room', 'AKA the other living room. Apparently Elvis was infatuated with Hawaii and wanted to make this sort of tropical themed room. There was a waterfall on one end and lots of green shag everywhere.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/436_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/436_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/436_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 70, '2011-08-02 17:45:24'),
(437, 1, '129', 'The Shooting Range', 'Originally this was the smokehouse but eventually it was converted into a pistol range.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/437_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/437_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/437_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-08-02 17:46:58'),
(438, 1, '129', 'The Best Portrait Ever', 'A collection of Elvis paintings.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/438_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/438_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/438_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 72, '2011-08-02 17:52:03'),
(439, 1, '129', 'Racquetball Lounge', 'I really liked these couches, brown is highly underrated. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/439_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/439_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/439_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 77, '2011-08-02 17:53:35'),
(441, 1, '129', 'America Suits', 'The crazily detailed eagle suits. U.S.A.!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/441_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/441_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/441_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 68, '2011-08-02 18:00:22'),
(442, 1, '129', 'Elvis'' Grave', 'Elvis was originally buried elsewhere but after someone tried to steal his body, he was reinterred at Graceland and was eventually joined by his mother, father, and still-born twin brother.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/442_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/442_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/442_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 91, '2011-08-02 18:03:15'),
(443, 1, '129', 'Graceland', 'Turns out Elvis didn''t name it Graceland. It was named after the previous owners daughter.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/443_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/443_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/443_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-08-02 18:05:10'),
(444, 1, '129', 'The Lisa Marie', 'Elvis'' awesome Convair 880 named for his daughter. Also known as Hound Dog One', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/444_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/444_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/444_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 90, '2011-08-02 18:15:56'),
(446, 1, '129', 'The Interior of The Lisa Marie', 'Elvis bought the plane for $250,000 which was a lot at the time and then dumped another $400,000 into refurbishing the interior to his specs including gold seatbelts and faucets.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/446_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/446_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/446_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-08-02 18:22:15'),
(445, 1, '129', 'Eagle Suit', 'I really liked the simple(ish) high contrast of this suit. This is in the former racquetball court that is now full of jumpsuits and extra gold records.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/445_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/445_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/445_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 68, '2011-08-02 18:20:00'),
(447, 1, '129', 'The Bar on Elvis'' Jet', 'Elvis didn''t really drink alcohol - he preferred dr pepper or gatorade - but he was a good host and always had a well stocked bar for guests.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/447_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/447_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/447_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 66, '2011-08-02 18:24:10'),
(448, 1, '129', 'Jet Bed', 'The bed in the Lisa Marie, Elvis'' jet. Notice the gold plated seatbelt.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/448_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/448_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/448_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 75, '2011-08-02 18:25:27'),
(449, 1, '129', 'Interior of the Hound Dog II', 'I really liked this one. The bright colors were still pretty fresh looking. This is his smaller JetStar that he called the Hound Dog II', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/449_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/449_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/449_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 105, '2011-08-02 18:27:11'),
(450, 1, '129', 'The Hound Dog II', 'Elvis kind of went on an airplane buying spree in 1975 and bought 6 of them. This was his smaller commuter style jet called the Hound Dog II. The best part other than the interior was that his pilot for this plane was named Milo High.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/450_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/450_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/450_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 102, '2011-08-02 18:30:19'),
(451, 1, '129', '880 Echo Papa', 'Elvis got a custom ID for the Lisa Marie. This is not something most normal people get to do.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/451_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/451_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/451_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 71, '2011-08-02 18:32:08'),
(458, 1, '47', 'Teepee Cafe', 'A sadly abandoned cafe in an old teepee. It''s for rent if anyone is looking for space in Bowie', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/458_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/458_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/458_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-05 23:12:26'),
(452, 1, '129', 'Graceland Toys', 'Elvis had a huge collection of cars but also mini bikes, scooters tractors and golf carts. He even had a snow mobile converted to run on the lawn at Graceland.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/452_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/452_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/452_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 98, '2011-08-02 18:36:14'),
(453, 1, '129', 'Stutz Bearcat', 'The awesomely gaudy Stutz Bearcat. Elvis also had a Stutz Blackhawk that he bought out from underneath Frank Sinatra.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/453_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/453_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/453_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 138, '2011-08-02 18:40:14'),
(454, 1, '129', 'Elvis'' Pink Cadillac', 'This one eventually belonged to his mother. He tended to buy cars and then give them away or trade for other ones pretty quickly.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/454_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/454_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/454_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 103, '2011-08-02 18:46:35'),
(455, 1, '129', 'Mercedes 600 Limo and 62 Lincoln', 'The 600 was amazing... that car never ceases to amaze me with its build quality. The Lincoln was great as well, gold details and a gold flaked crocodile skin roof.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/455_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/455_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/455_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 78, '2011-08-02 18:48:14'),
(456, 1, '129', 'The Suit from the Nixon / Elvis Meeting', 'Wherein Elvis went to the White House to meet Nixon and request that he be made a DEA agent so that he could get the badge for his collection.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/456_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/456_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/456_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 80, '2011-08-02 18:49:54'),
(457, 1, '129', 'Elvis Robot', 'I still find this hard to believe and i haven''t found any corroborating info, but it is in the museum. Apparently there were "robots" that wandered the halls of concerts but were eventually decommissioned when they "groped" a fan.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/457_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/457_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/457_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 117, '2011-08-02 18:53:51'),
(459, 1, '46', 'Cactus Fez', 'It was really really cold while we were in Tucson, so in order to protect the blooms they put all of the spare styrofoam cups on them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/459_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/459_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/459_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-05 23:19:18'),
(460, 1, '61', 'Restaurant Matador', 'A roadside matador in Tucson.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/460_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/460_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/460_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-05 23:22:16'),
(461, 1, '28', 'Toilet Rock', 'There aren''t enough rocks shaped like a toilet.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/461_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/461_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/461_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-05 23:23:27'),
(462, 1, '38', 'Downtown Mogollon', 'The main street of the ghost town Mogollon.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/462_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/462_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/462_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-05 23:24:35'),
(463, 1, '48', 'Missile Park', 'The Missile Garden is on an active military installation, so they are a little restrictive about where you can take photos.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/463_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/463_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/463_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-05 23:26:07'),
(464, 1, '48', 'Missile Garden', 'An awesome collection of missiles at the white sands missile range.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/464_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/464_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/464_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-05 23:27:29'),
(465, 1, '131', 'Guadalupe Mountain', 'Loved this place. Totally changed my opinion of west Texas.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/465_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/465_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/465_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-05 23:31:11'),
(466, 1, '49', 'Ham the Astrochimp', 'Ham was the most famous chimpstronaut. He went to space before any other american.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/466_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/466_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/466_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-05 23:34:12'),
(467, 1, '99', 'Carlsbad Columns', 'Everyone knows this cave but it really is one of the most beautiful of all of the caves we went to.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/467_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/467_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/467_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-05 23:36:38'),
(468, 1, '30', 'Santa Elena Canyon', 'One side of the canyon is Mexico the other side is the US', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/468_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/468_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/468_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-05 23:39:05'),
(469, 1, '35', 'Law West of The Pecos', 'Judge Roy Beans bar/court/home.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/469_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/469_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/469_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-05 23:41:01'),
(470, 1, '50', 'Remember The Alamo', 'Harder to photograph than expected, since it is downtown surrounded by tall buildings and hotels.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/470_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/470_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/470_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-05 23:43:59'),
(471, 1, '50', 'There''s No Basement at the Alamo', 'Nighttime at the Alamo.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/471_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/471_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/471_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-05 23:45:06'),
(472, 1, '33', 'The World''s Largest Cowboy Boots', 'One of the most Texan things i have ever seen. Though tucked away at some boring mall.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/472_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/472_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/472_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-05 23:47:12'),
(473, 1, '132', 'Mission San Jose', 'Everyone goes to San Antonio to see the Alamo but San Jose is amazing. Way cooler than the Alamo.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/473_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/473_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/473_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-05 23:50:49'),
(474, 1, '55', 'Longhorn Armadillo', 'The disco Armadillo at Goode''s Armadillo Palace.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/474_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/474_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/474_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-06 00:01:24'),
(475, 1, '56', 'Prepare for Trans-lunar Injection', 'Apollo Mission Control at Johnson Space Center.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/475_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/475_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/475_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-06 00:02:50'),
(476, 1, '56', 'The Rocket Shed', 'Inside of this shed is one of only three remaining Saturn V Rockets. This was the best one in our opinion.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/476_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/476_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/476_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-06 00:05:00'),
(477, 1, '56', 'The Robonaut', 'This is a prototype of the robot that was recently sent up to the ISS. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/477_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/477_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/477_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-06 00:07:30'),
(478, 1, '133', 'Alligators In the Area', 'Look out for the Chompigators.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/478_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/478_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/478_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-06 00:10:54'),
(479, 1, '63', 'Rosedown Avenue', 'The excellent tree lined avenue at a very well preserved plantation.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/479_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/479_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/479_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-06 00:13:32'),
(480, 1, '134', 'The Hit Drinking Game!', 'Booze It Up at the museum of the american cocktail.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/480_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/480_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/480_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-06 00:16:10'),
(481, 1, '134', 'Prescription Whiskey', 'From the great collection of old bottles at the museum of the american cocktail in new orleans.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/481_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/481_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/481_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-06 00:17:57'),
(482, 1, '66', 'Roadside Moon Lander', 'This was the trainer used by the apollo 13 astronauts that is now at a rest stop in Mississippi.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/482_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/482_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/482_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-06 00:20:21'),
(483, 1, '67', 'Approaching Gator', 'This was our first real gator sighting, though it was at a gator farm', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/483_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/483_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/483_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-06 00:23:31'),
(484, 1, '136', 'Fort Pickens Tunnel', 'These tunnels lead to chambers that were filled with black powder that could be ignited incase the fort were about to be lost. In fact this happened once and blew up a 5th of the fort.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/484_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/484_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/484_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-06 00:31:10'),
(485, 1, '31', 'The Dome of a Home', 'The hurricane proof house in pensacola.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/485_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/485_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/485_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-06 00:33:05'),
(486, 1, '74', 'Futuro House', 'Locally known as the spaceship house this is a great example of one of only 16 futuro''s in the US', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/486_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/486_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/486_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-06 00:38:26'),
(487, 1, '69', 'Abandoned Jai-Alai Fronton', 'The Big Bend Jai-Alai Fronton strangely in the middle of nowhere. You can see perhaps why it didn''t succeed. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/487_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/487_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/487_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 92, '2011-08-06 00:40:24'),
(488, 1, '75', 'The Crystal Ice House', 'One of the few remaining Ice Houses left in the US. This one is exquisite, but sadly surrounded by chainlink fence.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/488_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/488_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/488_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-06 00:43:02'),
(489, 1, '40', 'The Magic Kingdom', 'The castle at Disney World. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/489_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/489_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/489_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-06 00:45:28'),
(490, 1, '40', 'Fake Southwest', 'This provided some sense of familiarity to the southwest that we were missing while we were in florida, even though it was made from papier mache. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/490_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/490_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/490_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-06 00:47:54'),
(491, 1, '70', 'The Future is Triangles', 'A section of the sphere at EPCOT. This building was the best part of the whole place.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/491_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/491_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/491_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-06 00:49:37'),
(492, 1, '71', 'NASA', 'The sign at Kennedy Space Center. This place was not as good as Johnson in Houston but still a good visit.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/492_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/492_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/492_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-06 00:51:39');
INSERT INTO `photos` (`id`, `user_id`, `place_id`, `title`, `caption`, `url`, `thumbnail`, `med`, `width`, `height`, `active`, `views`, `created`) VALUES
(493, 1, '71', 'The Original Astrovan', 'The Cortez that NASA used to transport Apollo astronauts to the launchpad.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/493_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/493_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/493_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-06 00:52:51'),
(494, 1, '56', 'Shuttle Mockup', 'This is a full size mockup of the shuttle that you could go into to get a sense of scale.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/494_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/494_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/494_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-06 00:54:04'),
(495, 1, '137', 'The White Peacock', 'This is supposedly where Ponce de Leon''s expedition landed and discovered the fountain of youth. Now there are some awesome white peacocks.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/495_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/495_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/495_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 49, '2011-08-06 00:56:34'),
(496, 1, '137', 'The Actual (Possible) Fountain of Youth', 'This is the site where Ponce de Leon actually landed. And there is a natural spring there. So it might be the fountain of youth.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/496_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/496_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/496_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 53, '2011-08-06 00:59:25'),
(497, 1, '138', 'Memorial for the Confederate Dead', 'In Forsythe Park, a great place to lounge around after a nice day of walking about this beautiful city.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/497_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/497_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/497_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-06 10:12:02'),
(498, 1, '139', 'The Whoopie Pie', 'Very good. This is from the charleston outpost of the brooklyn bakery. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/498_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/498_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/498_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 55, '2011-08-07 19:55:15'),
(499, 1, '87', 'Illegal to Feed the Gators', 'There is a pond in the middle of Magnolia Cemetery that supposedly has gators, though we didn''t see any.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/499_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/499_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/499_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-07 19:57:44'),
(500, 1, '87', 'Confederate Submarine Crew', 'The crew of the CSS Hunley was buried here. The hunley is generally regarded as the first real submarine, and certainly the first actual combat submarine. It was lost after sinking the USS Housatonic in Charleston outer harbor. It was lost shortly afterward for unknown reasons.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/500_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/500_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/500_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-07 20:01:54'),
(501, 1, '94', 'Stone Mountain', 'The Confederate Mt Rushmore. Also carved by Gutzon Borglum (the same guy responsible for Rushmore) it was originally meant to be much larger in scale, but they ran out of money and momentum. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/501_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/501_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/501_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-07 20:08:26'),
(502, 1, '140', 'The Atlanta White House', 'A 3/4 scale replica of the White House in suburban Atlanta.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/502_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/502_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/502_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-07 20:11:29'),
(503, 1, '141', 'Incredible Hindu Temple', 'On the outskirts of Atlanta is this amazing stone temple. It is absolutely massive and super intricate.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/503_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/503_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/503_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-07 21:07:19'),
(504, 1, '97', 'Hand Lettered', 'A hand painted sign for a church near Foxfire in Northern Georgia', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/504_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/504_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/504_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-07 21:09:55'),
(505, 1, '97', 'Eastern Continental Divide', 'Not quite as steep as the western continental divide but it was awfully pretty here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/505_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/505_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/505_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-07 21:11:39'),
(506, 1, '142', 'Mill At Foxfire', 'We discovered on this trip that it was difficult to take a bad picture of a mill. Foxfire was one of the highlights of the trip, a collection of buildings moved or created as a way to preserve Appalachian folk knowledge.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/506_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/506_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/506_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-07 21:22:08'),
(507, 1, '143', 'Moonshiners Still', 'This still set up was on display at Great Smoky Mountains National Park. This is a good example of what one looks like. though often they were covered in clay and mud or bricks to keep them good and hot and mitigate against the boiler bursting.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/507_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/507_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/507_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-07 21:52:42'),
(508, 1, '144', 'God Before Mammon', 'A sign at a distillery in Gatlinburg that specialized in unaged whiskey, aka moonshine. It was actually pretty decent. The rest of Gatlinburg was sadly overrun by tourists now with gaudy ripley''s believe it or not kinda places. Though there was a dukes of hazzard museum that looked worthwhile.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/508_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/508_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/508_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-07 21:57:53'),
(509, 1, '143', 'The Appalachian Trail', 'One of the more popular parts of the trail is here in the smokies. That seems like a long way to walk.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/509_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/509_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/509_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 43, '2011-08-07 22:01:00'),
(510, 1, '145', 'Rock City!', 'An incredible outcrop of rock on lookout mountain. Used as a lookout during the civil war, now it is one of the most well advertised tourist attractions in the US. There are signs painted on barns from Florida to Michigan - SEE ROCK CITY!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/510_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/510_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/510_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 46, '2011-08-07 22:05:15'),
(511, 1, '146', 'Benton''s Country Hams', 'Oh man... I wish we lived closer to this place. Benton''s makes the ham for Momofuku Ssam Bar''s country ham plate as well as provided the bacon for one of the first bacon cocktails (the benton''s old fashioned). They also make the very best country breakfast sausage I have ever had.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/511_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/511_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/511_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 79, '2011-08-07 22:09:43'),
(512, 1, '147', 'See Rock City!', 'This is an example of one of the See Rock City barns that are still all over the country side. Some are pretty worn out but others have been lovingly maintained or restored.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/512_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/512_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/512_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-07 22:16:33'),
(513, 1, '39', 'Mr Jack', 'The original marble statue of Jack Daniel that sat outside by stream until weather started damaging it. Now it sits right inside the door of the visitor center.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/513_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/513_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/513_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-07 22:18:37'),
(514, 1, '39', 'The Safe That Killed Jack Daniel', 'This is the safe that Jack Daniel kicked which broke his toe and led to a fatal blood infection.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/514_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/514_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/514_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-07 22:20:59'),
(515, 1, '39', 'Jack Daniels Slogan', 'This was on the wall of Jack Daniel''s office.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/515_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/515_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/515_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 131, '2011-08-07 22:21:52'),
(516, 1, '76', 'George Dickel Barrels', 'I have millions of photos of whiskey barrels. I love them. You''re just gonna have to deal with it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/516_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/516_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/516_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 46, '2011-08-07 22:23:14'),
(517, 1, '148', 'The Stax Museum', 'This was one of our favorite museums on the trip. Stax produced some of our favorite soul and funk records along with loads of Otis Redding and Booker T and the MGs. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/517_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/517_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/517_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-07 22:26:46'),
(518, 1, '129', 'The GMC at Graceland', 'This is the wall in front of Graceland that is covered in millions of messages to Elvis. He used to come down to the gates most days to sign autographs of the throngs of fans that gathered outside.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/518_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/518_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/518_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 63, '2011-08-07 22:28:40'),
(519, 1, '129', 'Taking Care of Business in a Flash', 'Elvis'' logo on the tail of his jet the Lisa Marie. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/519_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/519_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/519_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 73, '2011-08-07 22:29:49'),
(520, 1, '149', 'Hatch Show Print', 'Hatch is an amazing letterpress studio in Nashville that has some of the best examples of concert letter press posters. They have a store up front where you can buy posters and their studio in the back.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/520_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/520_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/520_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 62, '2011-08-07 22:32:21'),
(521, 1, '150', 'Ernest Tubb''s Record Shop', 'A great collection of western swing and older country. Ernest Tubb was an epically famous country and western star.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/521_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/521_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/521_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 59, '2011-08-07 22:34:24'),
(522, 1, '151', 'Concrete Parthenon', 'A full scale replica of the Parthenon made from concrete. It was built in 1897 as part of Tennessee''s Centennial.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/522_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/522_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/522_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 64, '2011-08-07 22:39:22'),
(523, 1, '152', 'Thunder Chicken', 'Probably the best car logo ever on a Pontiac Thunderbird.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/523_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/523_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/523_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 52, '2011-08-07 22:43:35'),
(524, 1, '153', 'Temperance Poster', 'A poster extolling the virtues of temperance at the Oscar Getz whiskey museum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/524_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/524_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/524_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 59, '2011-08-07 22:47:53'),
(525, 1, '153', 'Whiskey Is The Best Medicine', 'An old decanter with the right sentiment at the whiskey museum in bardstown', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/525_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/525_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/525_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-07 22:50:01'),
(526, 1, '154', 'Attention to Detail', 'All of the shutters at Makers Mark have the outline of the bottle cut out from them. This was the most beautiful distillery we went to.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/526_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/526_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/526_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 52, '2011-08-07 22:53:47'),
(527, 1, '154', 'See 7 States!', 'More excellent barn advertisements for Rock City. The See 7 States message was pretty popular.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/527_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/527_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/527_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-07 22:56:27'),
(528, 1, '155', 'The Ham and Gun Store', 'The front of the store sold hams and smoked and cured meats and the rest of the store sold every single gun ever manufactured. There were pink anodized derringers and even an actual tommy gun. I can''t imagine there is any other place in the world where you can buy a country ham and a silencer.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/528_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/528_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/528_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 66, '2011-08-07 23:06:11'),
(529, 1, '156', 'Still at Buffalo Trace', 'This is one of the Bourbon stills at Buffalo Trace.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/529_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/529_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/529_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 46, '2011-08-09 14:26:05'),
(530, 1, '157', 'Cypress Fermentation Tanks', 'Woodford''s is small enough that they still use cypress fermentation tanks. Gives it a much less industrial factory kind of feel than most other distilleries.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/530_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/530_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/530_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 52, '2011-08-09 14:33:55'),
(531, 1, '157', 'Woodford Reserve Ricks', 'This is in the aging warehouse at Woodford. This is a super old limestone warehouse also called a rickhouse because the barrels are stored in structures called ricks', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/531_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/531_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/531_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-10 22:47:42'),
(532, 1, '158', 'The Colonel', 'Bust of Colonel Sanders at his grave in Louisville Ky', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/532_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/532_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/532_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-10 22:50:12'),
(533, 1, '158', 'Final Resting Place of the Colonel', 'The grave of Colonel Harlan Sanders of Kentucky Fried Chicken fame.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/533_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/533_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/533_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-10 22:51:47'),
(534, 1, '159', 'Happy Water Tower', 'One of the better water towers we saw on this trip. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/534_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/534_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/534_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-10 22:57:13'),
(535, 1, '160', 'Buck Rogers Water Tower', 'This water tower was amazing. super futuristic in a 1930s kinda way. it has a spiral staircase that leads up to a viewing platform about halfway up', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/535_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/535_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/535_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-10 23:03:04'),
(536, 1, '13', 'Tiny Church', 'One of the smallest of many roadside tiny churches.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/536_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/536_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/536_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-10 23:07:35'),
(537, 1, '21', 'Bridge Out', 'The McPhaul Bridge in Yuma also known as the Bridge to nowhere since it goes from nowhere to nowhere over a river that isn''t there anymore.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/537_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/537_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/537_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-10 23:08:54'),
(538, 1, '5', 'SR71 Blackbird', 'This was the first of many blackbirds we have seen on this trip. The fastest plane in the world.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/538_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/538_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/538_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-10 23:10:46'),
(539, 1, '3', 'Bulldozer Building', 'An office building inside of a giant bulldozer where they sell regular sized bulldozers.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/539_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/539_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/539_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 17, '2011-08-10 23:11:55'),
(540, 1, '5', 'Blackbird Tail', 'The rear stabilizers on the Castle museum Blackbird.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/540_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/540_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/540_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-10 23:16:54'),
(541, 1, '4', 'Vasquez Rocks', 'Where starship captains and aliens work out their differences.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/541_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/541_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/541_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-10 23:18:24'),
(542, 1, '11', 'Joshua Tree', 'The trees that Joshua Tree National Park is known for are amazing but my favorite thing here are the rocks. Even better when the trees and the rocks work together.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/542_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/542_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/542_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-10 23:21:21'),
(543, 1, '12', 'North Shore Yacht Club', 'The very nicely restored Albert Frey classic yacht club on the salton sea.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/543_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/543_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/543_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-10 23:25:57'),
(544, 1, '6', 'Salvation Mountain', '100,000 gallons of paint, a hill and some religious devotion.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/544_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/544_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/544_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-10 23:27:07'),
(545, 1, '7', 'Center of the World', 'The pyramid at the center of the world. You can go inside stand in the exact center and make a wish. then you get a certificate saying you visited the center of the world.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/545_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/545_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/545_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-10 23:32:27'),
(546, 1, '42', 'The Guard House', 'The old guard tower at Yuma Territorial Prison. The view up here was amazing, you could see the river down below and way out into the valley for miles.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/546_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/546_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/546_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-10 23:34:27'),
(547, 1, '42', 'The Main Cellblock', 'These are the entrances to the cells in the main cellblock. Really a classic view of this place... not really a place you would want to spend a summer.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/547_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/547_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/547_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-10 23:35:42'),
(548, 1, '44', 'Archway', 'One of the gates into the mission.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/548_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/548_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/548_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-10 23:38:29'),
(549, 1, '44', 'The Mission', 'One of the most beautiful and well restored of the missions. This one is still active as well so it feels so much more alive that any other one.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/549_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/549_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/549_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-10 23:41:07'),
(550, 1, '29', 'The Great House', 'The ruins at Casa Grande under the protective ramada.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/550_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/550_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/550_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-10 23:42:32'),
(551, 1, '58', 'Superstition Mountain Chapel', 'Superstition Mountain is where the lost dutchman mine is supposedly located. This is an old film set at the base of the mountain that affords some very nice views.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/551_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/551_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/551_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-10 23:45:19'),
(552, 1, '161', 'Bruce Goff''s Grave', 'The very Star Trek looking grave of one of our favorite architects. He worked a lot with bits of broken glass like the green chunk on his stone. The best thing is that this was next to L. Mies van der Rohe''s very understated modernist black stone, kinda awesomely incongruous and they couldn''t have been more different types of architects.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/552_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/552_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/552_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-10 23:51:16'),
(553, 1, '162', 'Concrete Corncob', 'The Marina Towers condos. One of the best looking exteriors of any tall buildings. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/553_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/553_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/553_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-10 23:55:57'),
(554, 1, '163', 'The Bean', 'Everyone that goes to Chicago has to have a photo of this guy. It is more officially known as The Cloud Gate by Anish Kapoor and is the centerpiece of Millennium Park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/554_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/554_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/554_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-10 23:59:26'),
(555, 1, '164', 'Spitting Image', 'Crown Fountain is a giant video installation-meets-fountain in Millennium Park. There are two towers with giant videos of peoples faces spitting water into the huge reflecting pool underneath.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/555_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/555_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/555_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-11 00:05:57'),
(556, 1, '162', 'Scalloped', 'The towers at Marina City, Bertrand Goldberg''s scalloped masterpiece.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/556_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/556_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/556_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-11 00:10:51'),
(557, 1, '165', 'The Start of Route 66', 'The start of the mother road in downtown chicago. it goes from here on to Santa Monica 2451 miles later.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/557_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/557_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/557_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-11 21:16:39'),
(558, 1, '166', 'The Star Streak II', 'The very best motorhome ever made from bits of old Cadillacs. It was surprisingly well made.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/558_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/558_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/558_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 50, '2011-08-11 21:28:22'),
(559, 1, '166', 'The Star Streak II', 'Built from the leftover bits of Cadillac Eldorado''s, this is really the ugliest and best RV ever.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/559_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/559_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/559_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 113, '2011-08-11 21:34:03'),
(560, 1, '166', 'The RV Museum', 'This is a great museum that covers RV history. They have a bunch of RVs ranging from about 100 years ago up to now all laid out along a winding road. For the most part you can go inside all of them to get a great perspective of how they have evolved.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/560_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/560_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/560_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 57, '2011-08-11 21:38:21'),
(561, 1, '166', 'RV Logo', 'The logo on the mustang, which was one of my favorite RVs at the museum. It was two stories and was decorated like a 70s porn set.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/561_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/561_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/561_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-11 21:40:29'),
(562, 1, '166', 'The Littlest Airstream', 'This was a prototype to see if something this small would be workable, and indeed it was. It was tiny but it was really well laid out inside.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/562_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/562_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/562_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-11 21:43:07'),
(563, 1, '167', 'No Drinking and Camping', 'A sign in a campground telling us not to drink, or not to drink martini''s anyway.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/563_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/563_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/563_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-11 21:46:46'),
(564, 1, '168', 'Johnson Wax Building', 'The Frank Lloyd Wright designed R&D building at Johnson Wax Headquarters. This is one of only two tall buildings that Wright built. Sadly it is not fire safe so no one can go in it any more.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/564_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/564_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/564_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-11 21:53:34'),
(565, 1, '168', 'Pilotis', 'The interior of the Frank Lloyd Wright designed Johnson Wax Headquarters. They don''t allow photos in here but I was able to take a blurry photo from my pocket. These giant pillars are also called pilotis.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/565_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/565_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/565_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-11 22:01:52'),
(566, 1, '169', 'Miller Time', 'Tasting at Miller Brewery, they pour basically as much as you like here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/566_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/566_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/566_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-11 22:18:31'),
(567, 1, '169', 'The Girl in the Moon', 'A great stained glass window into part of the brewery of the miller girl in the moon logo.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/567_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/567_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/567_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-11 22:20:52'),
(568, 1, '169', 'Lauter Tun', 'One of the fermentation tanks at Miller.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/568_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/568_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/568_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 17, '2011-08-11 22:21:41'),
(569, 1, '170', 'Ecto One', 'The ghostbusters ambulance, at the the best car museum ever.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/569_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/569_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/569_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-11 22:33:35'),
(570, 1, '170', 'Kennedy Motorcade', 'Jim Lensing, the guy that owns this museum, has the most insane collection of cars. He collects everything around the car, this is one of the cars from the kennedy motorcade. He also has bits of the fence from the grassy knoll, the window next to the one that oswald shot through, even the actual catalog that oswald used to mail order his gun.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/570_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/570_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/570_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-11 22:50:44'),
(571, 1, '170', 'Fence from the Grassy Knoll', 'A bit of the grassy knoll where the second shooter might have been. Covered in conspiracy graffiti. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/571_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/571_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/571_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-11 22:56:04'),
(572, 1, '170', 'Bonnie and Clyde Car', 'This is from the movie, but a nice piece none the less.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/572_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/572_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/572_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-11 22:58:53'),
(573, 1, '170', 'The Duke''s Shoehorn', 'A good example of the randomness of the collection of stuff at historic auto attractions. A shoe horn that once belonged to John Wayne.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/573_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/573_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/573_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-11 23:01:29'),
(574, 1, '171', 'The USS RIverside', 'A starship model in Riverside Iowa, the future birthplace of James Tiberius Kirk.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/574_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/574_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/574_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-11 23:08:46'),
(575, 1, '171', 'Shuttlecraft', 'A shuttlecraft model in the Star Trek crazy town of Riverside IA, The future birthplace of Captain James T. Kirk.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/575_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/575_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/575_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-11 23:15:46'),
(576, 1, '171', 'The Future Birthplace of Captain Kirk', 'Behind a shop in a tiny little town, is a (birth?) stone commemorating the future birthplace of Captain James T Kirk.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/576_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/576_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/576_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 68, '2011-08-11 23:19:52'),
(577, 1, '172', 'Trainland USA', 'A series of train dioramas, set up to emulate most major cities in the US.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/577_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/577_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/577_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-11 23:24:59'),
(578, 1, '173', 'The Hall of Waters', 'A WPA built building where the water from 5 different mineral springs is piped in to a long bar, where people could drink each of the waters which had different properties.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/578_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/578_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/578_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-11 23:31:41'),
(579, 1, '173', 'The Water Bar', 'The water bar at the Hall of Waters. From here you could purchase many different kinds of mineral water with restorative properties. It is a beautiful deco style bar with mayan details.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/579_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/579_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/579_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-11 23:33:32'),
(580, 1, '173', 'Mayan Detail', 'One of the tiles around the entrance of the Hall of Waters. This was built during a period of many Mayan discoveries and Mayan imagery made it into many deco buildings.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/580_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/580_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/580_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-11 23:35:23'),
(581, 1, '174', 'GMC Afternoon', 'The GMC set up at Clinton Lake just outside of Lawrence. This was a perfect evening, warm, excellent light, fireflies later on, Kansas did good.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/581_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/581_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/581_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-11 23:39:41'),
(582, 1, '175', 'Buffalo Chair', 'The first of several buffalo horn chairs. This was probably the best one.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/582_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/582_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/582_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-12 20:23:10'),
(583, 1, '175', 'S.P. Dinsmoor''s Tomb', 'Dinsmoor built the crazy Garden of Eden out of hist yard and eventually was buried here with instructions to charge people to see his grave.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/583_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/583_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/583_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-12 20:26:23'),
(584, 1, '176', 'Spherical Boulder', 'The near perfect spheres at Rock City... Not to be confused with city of rocks that we went to in new mexico and also is not the rock city that we went to in Chattanooga.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/584_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/584_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/584_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-12 20:32:40'),
(586, 1, '176', 'Welcome to Rock City!', 'A blend of many typefaces.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/586_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/586_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/586_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-12 20:49:33'),
(585, 1, '176', 'Rock CIty!', 'Full of strangely spherical boulders.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/585_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/585_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/585_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-12 20:42:24'),
(587, 1, '176', 'Weathered Rock Texture', 'A close up of one of the spherical boulders at Rock CIty.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/587_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/587_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/587_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-12 20:51:30'),
(588, 1, '177', 'The Coronado Heights WPA Castle', 'A great picnic area at the top of a rare hill in Kansas that provides a beautiful view of the surrounding prairie. This place was built in the 30s by the WPA and named because supposedly (very doubtfully) Coronado came through this area.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/588_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/588_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/588_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-12 21:01:37'),
(589, 1, '177', 'WPA Castle', 'The picnic castle built by the WPA on top of a rare hill in Kansas.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/589_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/589_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/589_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-12 21:05:08'),
(590, 1, '178', 'The Temperature is Too Damn High!', 'It actually got up to 115 degrees at another point. This was hotter than i prefer it to be when there is humidity involved.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/590_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/590_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/590_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-12 21:10:04'),
(591, 1, '178', 'Tornado Time', 'This was a few minutes before we had to go down into the basement. Alana didn''t really enjoy tornados.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/591_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/591_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/591_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-12 21:13:11'),
(592, 1, '179', 'Soviet Lunar Sphere', 'This was a backup, but this was shot up to the moon where it exploded before it hit the surface of the moon leaving a bunch of little CCCP calling cards on the moon''s surface.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/592_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/592_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/592_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-12 21:17:07'),
(593, 1, '179', 'Aldrin''s Hassleblad Back', 'All of the photos from the moon were taken with hasselblad cameras, but in order to save weight they just left the bodies on the moon and brought the film backs home. I like the idea of a pile of hassy''s sitting on the moon.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/593_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/593_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/593_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-12 21:20:49'),
(594, 1, '179', 'Kansas SR71', 'One of the many Blackbirds we saw on this trip. This one had been manhandled by millions of kids rubbing the paint of of the nose, but it was still great.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/594_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/594_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/594_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 48, '2011-08-12 21:24:01'),
(595, 1, '180', 'Frank Lloyd Wright''s Allen Lambe House', 'Built for the local newspaper publisher and Kansas Governor Henry J. Allen. This was a great tour and really highlighted the crazy details that FLW put into his designs.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/595_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/595_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/595_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 51, '2011-08-12 21:29:55'),
(596, 1, '181', 'The Suitcase That Killed Tom Mix', 'One of these cases was the one that brained Cowboy Superstar Tom Mix when he crashed his car, killing him instantly. Supposedly the suitcase was full of jewels and travelers checks.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/596_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/596_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/596_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 73, '2011-08-13 21:20:22'),
(597, 1, '181', 'Tony The Wonder Horse', 'A big part of the reason that tom mix was so good at what he did was because of Tony the Wonder Horse. This is a plaster recreation of him.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/597_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/597_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/597_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-13 21:23:47'),
(598, 1, '181', 'Tom Mix''s White Hat', 'Tom Mix believed that by setting a good example he could set kids on the right path in life. He was always the good guy, and you could tell because he wore a white hat.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/598_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/598_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/598_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 64, '2011-08-13 21:26:36'),
(599, 1, '182', 'The Price Tower', 'Frank Lloyd Wright''s only real skyscraper. Built for Harold C. Price who made a boatload in the oil pipeline business. Now it is a hotel and a museum showcasing Wright''s designs. Though like most Wright buildings, you can''t take photos inside.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/599_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/599_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/599_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-13 21:35:38'),
(600, 1, '182', 'Wright''s Price Tower', 'Frank Lloyd Wright''s Oklahoma skyscraper. Covered in copper that has aged in such a way that it is constantly evolving.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/600_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/600_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/600_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-13 21:40:10'),
(601, 1, '182', 'Oklahoma Skyscraper', 'Frank Lloyd Wright''s only real skyscraper, built for oilman H.C. Price in Bartlesville OK.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/601_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/601_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/601_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-13 21:43:24'),
(602, 1, '183', 'Bruce Goff''s Play Tower', 'in Sooner Park in Bartlesville OK. This is another bit of great architecture sponsored by the Price Family. Sadly this has fallen into disrepair but there are continued efforts to restore it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/602_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/602_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/602_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 66, '2011-08-13 21:56:00'),
(603, 1, '184', 'Bruce Goff''s Redeemer Lutheran Church', 'This is the education building that was designed by Bruce Goff. It uses his green glass "cutlets" up in the corners for a really unique organic efect.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/603_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/603_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/603_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-13 22:05:15'),
(604, 1, '185', 'Motsenbocker House', 'One of Bruce Goff''s many residences in Bartlesville. This was under some kind of restoration while we were there.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/604_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/604_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/604_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-13 22:14:23'),
(605, 1, '186', '16Oz of BBQ Sauce', 'You aren''t allowed to use the 16 ounce soda cups to dish up BBQ Sauce at Oklahoma Joes. Though after having their excellent sauce, i sort of saw the logic.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/605_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/605_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/605_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-13 22:22:21'),
(606, 1, '187', 'No Guns Allowed', 'This was a common sight throughout the south and midwest. Didn''t actually see too many people with guns but definitely lots of signs saying that you couldn''t bring them inside. (This was taken at a little cafe called Wheatfields that makes great sandwiches.)', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/606_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/606_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/606_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-13 22:28:55'),
(607, 1, '98', 'Holy Family Shrine', 'An amazing Catholic shrine on a hill overlooking highway 80 in Nebraska. I though the design suggested wheat sheaves.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/607_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/607_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/607_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-13 22:35:26'),
(608, 1, '98', 'The Holy Family Shrine', 'A roadside catholic shrine in nebraska', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/608_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/608_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/608_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 55, '2011-08-13 23:04:06'),
(609, 1, '189', 'SR71 Blackbird', 'One of the many blackbirds that we have seen on this trip. The way that this was displayed was my favorite of all.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/609_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/609_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/609_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 71, '2011-08-13 23:13:09'),
(610, 1, '189', 'SAC Logo', 'The best of all military logos.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/610_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/610_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/610_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-13 23:17:10'),
(611, 1, '189', 'Thermonuclear Bomb', 'The shell of a nuclear bomb.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/611_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/611_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/611_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-13 23:25:55'),
(612, 1, '189', 'Good Attitude', 'Nice to see a good attitude in the military.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/612_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/612_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/612_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-13 23:29:37'),
(613, 1, '189', 'Control Console', 'The red phone', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/613_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/613_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/613_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-13 23:33:01'),
(614, 1, '190', 'Corn Lamp Posts', 'The lamp posts in Mitchell are all corn themed.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/614_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/614_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/614_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-14 10:56:48'),
(615, 1, '190', 'The Corn Palace', 'A building covered in murals made from corn. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/615_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/615_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/615_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-14 11:04:20'),
(616, 1, '190', 'The Only Corn Palace', 'Everywhere they advertise, they say that it is the worlds ONLY corn palace. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/616_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/616_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/616_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-14 11:05:21'),
(617, 1, '191', 'Hey Big Buffalo!', 'A gigantic bison on the side of the road in South Dakota.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/617_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/617_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/617_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-14 11:16:30'),
(618, 1, '191', 'Bison Horn Chair', 'One of several awesome chairs made from Bison horns that we encountered along the way', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/618_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/618_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/618_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-14 11:17:53'),
(622, 1, '194', 'South Dakota Clouds', 'We ended up loving South Dakota. The sky was huge and always full of amazing clouds. This little church was off in the distance near 1880 Town', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/622_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/622_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/622_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-14 11:35:13'),
(621, 1, '193', 'Crazy Storm Finally Clears', 'The insane stom from Nebraska followed us until we got to the middle of South Dakota. But once it cleared up South Dakota became absolutely beautiful.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/621_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/621_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/621_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 58, '2011-08-14 11:30:25'),
(620, 1, '192', 'Most Insane Storm', 'The sky went from full sun to nighttime black in 20 minutes and then dumped 4 inches of rain on us in 30 min. I accidentally left the little side window open for a few minutes and it was like someone poked a firehose inside the coach.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/620_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/620_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/620_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-14 11:27:24'),
(623, 1, '194', 'Saloon', 'The Saloon at 1880 town on a particularly photogenic day.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/623_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/623_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/623_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-15 17:01:19'),
(624, 1, '195', 'Prairie Dogs', 'A Prairie Dog colony full of many many little creatures that are very docile and friendly. Largely because you can buy peanuts at the store to feed them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/624_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/624_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/624_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 59, '2011-08-15 21:06:46'),
(625, 1, '195', '12 Foot Tall Prairie Dog', 'The giant concrete prairie dog near Badlands National Park', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/625_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/625_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/625_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 54, '2011-08-15 21:29:35'),
(626, 1, '108', 'Badlands, Or Goodlands?', 'Driving into Badlands National Park. There really is no part of this area that isn''t awesome.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/626_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/626_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/626_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-15 21:33:16'),
(627, 1, '108', 'Badlands Loop', 'Driving along Badlands Loop in one of the most underrated national parks', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/627_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/627_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/627_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-15 21:36:37'),
(628, 1, '108', 'Spectrum', 'A nearly full spectrum of colors', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/628_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/628_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/628_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-15 21:42:04'),
(629, 1, '108', 'Mounds', 'The rocks here have such incredible colors and textures towards the end of the day.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/629_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/629_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/629_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-15 21:44:22'),
(630, 1, '107', 'Minute Man Missile Silo', 'The glass cover over the silo and decommissioned missile. It is just off the side of the highway.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/630_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/630_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/630_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 57, '2011-08-15 21:47:13'),
(631, 1, '107', 'Secret Missile Silo This Way', 'The sign guiding you to the missile silo part of the installation.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/631_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/631_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/631_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 108, '2011-08-15 21:51:43'),
(632, 1, '107', 'Stay Out Or Die', 'Old no trespassing sign on the missile silo.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/632_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/632_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/632_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-18 18:01:44');
INSERT INTO `photos` (`id`, `user_id`, `place_id`, `title`, `caption`, `url`, `thumbnail`, `med`, `width`, `height`, `active`, `views`, `created`) VALUES
(633, 1, '107', 'Minuteman Command Capsule', 'The underground control facility of a minuteman missile.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/633_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/633_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/633_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-18 18:02:58'),
(634, 1, '107', '30 Minute Delivery Guaranteed', 'This must have been a popular motif for the blast doors.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/634_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/634_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/634_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-18 18:04:14'),
(635, 1, '107', 'Take that Commies!', 'Art By Dudes With The Launch Keys', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/635_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/635_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/635_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 49, '2011-08-18 18:06:49'),
(636, 1, '114', 'Giant Jackalope!', 'Alana hops on to what must be the worlds largest jackalope. We had to wait in line with a bunch of kids to get on this thing.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/636_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/636_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/636_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-18 18:08:02'),
(637, 1, '108', 'Astropop', 'The colors in the badlands are indescribably amazing.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/637_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/637_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/637_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-18 18:09:33'),
(638, 1, '107', 'Minuteman II Nuclear Missile', 'Looking down the silo of a nuclear missile.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/638_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/638_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/638_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 53, '2011-08-18 18:10:49'),
(639, 1, '111', 'Here Come The Spaceships', 'Crazy thunderstorm in rapid city South Dakota', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/639_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/639_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/639_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-18 20:37:38'),
(640, 1, '111', 'South Dakota''s Insane Weather', 'The other side of that insane storm that had even the locals gawking.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/640_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/640_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/640_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-18 20:43:09'),
(641, 1, '102', 'Roadside Buffalo', 'A bison on the side of the road in custer state park. He pretty much just hung out here all day eating grass.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/641_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/641_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/641_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-18 20:46:52'),
(642, 1, '109', 'Mammoth', 'A Complete Mammoth Skull at the amazing Mammoth site', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/642_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/642_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/642_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-18 20:59:50'),
(643, 1, '109', 'Mammoth Skeleton', 'A reconstructed Columbian Mammoth with Alana standing somewhat indifferently below it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/643_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/643_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/643_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 16, '2011-08-18 21:05:41'),
(644, 1, '105', 'Mount Rushmore', 'The long view of the stone faced gentlemen.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/644_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/644_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/644_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-18 21:09:00'),
(645, 1, '105', 'Stone Faced', 'Mount Rushmore was way cooler than we expected it to be. It is just completely ridiculous both in size and intent.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/645_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/645_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/645_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-18 21:14:16'),
(646, 1, '105', 'Framed Rushmore', 'Instagram framed up looking down the avenue of the flags.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/646_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/646_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/646_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-18 21:18:37'),
(647, 1, '104', 'Crazy Horse Monument', 'The still unfinished Crazy Horse Monument. He has a face and kind of an arm... but they still have to carve the hand and the horse under the arm.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/647_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/647_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/647_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-18 21:31:01'),
(648, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake', 'The super beautiful Sylvan Lake in Custer State Park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/648_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/648_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/648_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-18 21:34:11'),
(649, 1, '103', 'Tiny Arch', 'The Needles Eye, a very narrow arch near the tunneled section by Sylvan Lake', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/649_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/649_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/649_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-18 21:36:54'),
(650, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake Tunnels', 'The tunnels through the mountain near Sylvan Lake. These tunnels are super narrow, but some how the tour bus drivers manage to barely fit their buses through there.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/650_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/650_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/650_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-18 21:39:06'),
(651, 1, '102', 'Wild Burros', 'Two wild burros necking at sunset.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/651_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/651_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/651_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-18 21:42:38'),
(652, 1, '103', 'Sylvan Lake', 'One of the most beautiful bodies of water that we saw on this trip.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/652_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/652_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/652_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-18 21:51:06'),
(653, 1, '111', 'Vixen 21', 'Our motorhome''s spiritual successor, the Vixen 21. Built by a former DeLorean manager who took a vacation in a GMC like ours and wanted to create a smaller version.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/653_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/653_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/653_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 51, '2011-08-18 21:53:04'),
(654, 1, '197', 'Magnum PI''s Ferrari 308', 'A very strange museum of movie artifacts in Deadwood. This was the 308 made famous in Magnum PI.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/654_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/654_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/654_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-20 11:59:24'),
(655, 1, '197', 'Deadwood Manhole Cover', 'I like that this town once had a large enough population and need that it had its own foundry for making manhole covers.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/655_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/655_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/655_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-20 12:02:07'),
(656, 1, '198', 'Justice', 'This is where they captured the Wild Bill''s assassin. Though, like most of deadwood, this building burnt down in 1879.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/656_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/656_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/656_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-20 12:10:54'),
(657, 1, '125', 'Seth Bullock''s Grave', 'The grave of Deadwood''s first sheriff (and basis for the lead character of Deadwood the show).', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/657_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/657_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/657_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-20 12:13:13'),
(658, 1, '125', 'Calamity Jane''s Grave', 'Jane asked to be buried next to Wild Bill, and she is. It is a pretty understated grave for such a flamboyant character.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/658_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/658_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/658_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-20 12:14:59'),
(659, 1, '125', 'Wild Bill Hickok''s Grave', 'The bronze bust of Wild Bill at his grave site. It is very strangely situated in terms of really being able to see it or photograph it, but many people have placed coins and cards at the base of his monument. Someone had even placed the "Dead-Man''s Hand" at the base, two aces and two 8s, supposedly the hand hickock was holding when he was shot.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/659_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/659_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/659_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-20 12:18:23'),
(660, 1, '128', 'Pit', 'The former pit mine of the homestake mine, george hearst''s deadwood operation.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/660_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/660_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/660_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-20 12:21:47'),
(661, 1, '128', 'Striations', 'The the strata in the face of the homestake mine pit.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/661_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/661_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/661_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-20 12:23:05'),
(662, 1, '199', 'View From Our Campground', 'This campground was actually great. Of course we had this insane view from our site, but they also screened close encounters every night.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/662_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/662_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/662_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 17, '2011-08-20 12:25:30'),
(663, 1, '106', 'Scratches', 'Legend says that the scratches on the sides of the tower were created by a giant bear that was trying to get 7 maidens that the gods had protected by raising the earth up into the sky.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/663_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/663_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/663_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 12:27:53'),
(664, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower', 'The tower at sunset. This was the best place to get a longer view of the tower.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/664_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/664_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/664_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 12:29:05'),
(665, 1, '106', 'Devils Tower Through the Grass', 'There is a beautiful meadow to the north west of the tower that is a great place to spend sunset.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/665_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/665_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/665_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-20 12:30:24'),
(666, 1, '112', 'Now That''s What I Call Native American!', 'These Teepee''s cracked me up. Nothing like a little comedy at a somber national memorial.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/666_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/666_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/666_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 16, '2011-08-20 12:32:09'),
(667, 1, '112', 'Cavalryman''s Resting Place', 'Little Bighorn is laid out so there are often monuments where people from both sides of the battle fell.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/667_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/667_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/667_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-20 12:34:03'),
(668, 1, '112', 'Last Stand Hill', 'This is where Custer fell. The stone with the black face is Custer''s. He was later removed and reinterred at West Point.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/668_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/668_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/668_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 19, '2011-08-20 12:37:28'),
(669, 1, '200', 'High Life', 'Hanging out at the campsite after visiting Little Bighorn. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/669_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/669_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/669_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-20 12:41:07'),
(670, 1, '201', 'Meandering in Montana', 'Cruising north towards Glacier', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/670_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/670_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/670_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 12:46:09'),
(671, 1, '113', 'Buffalo Skull', 'One of Charlie Russell''s Buffalo skulls in his studio. The bison ended up being one of his trademarks and the skull was part of his signature. Many credit his artwork and portrayal of the american west and the bison in particular as instigating the drive to save them from extinction.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/671_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/671_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/671_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-20 12:48:55'),
(672, 1, '113', 'Buffalo Horn Chair', 'Didn''t expect to see so many horn chairs on this trip but this was our 4th! The horns on this one are buffalo and made by a local tribe.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/672_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/672_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/672_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 56, '2011-08-20 12:54:33'),
(673, 1, '113', 'Russell''s Studio', 'Another bison horn chair in the amazing studio of Charlie Russell.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/673_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/673_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/673_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-20 12:57:57'),
(674, 1, '110', 'Coldest Penguin in America', 'Cut Bank is supposedly the coldest place in america.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/674_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/674_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/674_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 12:59:20'),
(675, 1, '202', 'Espresso Teepee', 'I really like Teepee buildings though many are abandoned. This one still has a business in it, a coffee shop.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/675_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/675_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/675_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 138, '2011-08-20 13:02:25'),
(676, 1, '203', 'About to Cross the Rockies', 'Can''t believe that we are about to cross back over the rockies in a 33 year old vehicle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/676_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/676_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/676_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 13:06:11'),
(677, 1, '204', 'Glacier National Park Lodge', 'The biggest of the Glacier Park lodges, this one''s lobby is basically dwarfed by the giant trees, bark still on, that they used as the support poles.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/677_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/677_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/677_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 13:08:46'),
(678, 1, '204', 'Glacier Tour Bus', 'They recently reintroduced the original open-top tourbuses that they had since the 30s. They had Ford completely redo them and update them to run on propane. There are nearly 40 of them and they are everywhere. A great sight in the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/678_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/678_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/678_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-20 13:11:04'),
(679, 1, '113', 'Headdress', 'Part of an exhibit of head dresses at the Russell Museum', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/679_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/679_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/679_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 13:12:00'),
(680, 1, '205', 'Glacier National Park', 'The view across Lake McDonald in Glacier.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/680_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/680_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/680_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-20 13:14:13'),
(681, 1, '205', 'Abstract Glacier Mural', 'A great mural on the side of a building near the lodge depicting the mountains.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/681_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/681_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/681_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 49, '2011-08-20 13:17:14'),
(682, 1, '206', 'Wild Goose Island', 'A tiny island in the beautiful St Mary Lake on the east side of the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/682_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/682_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/682_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-20 13:20:32'),
(683, 1, '205', 'Boat Ride', 'The dock that launches the boat tours of Lake McDonald.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/683_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/683_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/683_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-20 13:21:31'),
(684, 1, '205', 'Smore''s Time', 'Making smores for the first time on this trip', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/684_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/684_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/684_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-20 13:38:24'),
(685, 1, '112', 'Unknown Soldier', 'Where an unknown soldier fell at little bighorn.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/685_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/685_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/685_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-20 13:40:02'),
(686, 1, '207', 'Big Red Wagon', 'The giant wagon slide in Spokane.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/686_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/686_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/686_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-20 13:42:27'),
(687, 1, '207', 'Giant Blocks', 'Kids really seemed to love these blocks.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/687_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/687_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/687_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-20 13:44:55'),
(688, 1, '208', 'Spokane Falls', 'The falls in spokane are pretty interesting, they drop in a number of places and here they surround a sizable island traversed by several foot bridges.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/688_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/688_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/688_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 13:46:41'),
(689, 1, '209', 'Windmill Garden', 'A collection of hundreds of windmills made from random junk.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/689_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/689_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/689_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-20 13:51:23'),
(690, 1, '209', 'Windmills', 'A vast collection of folk art windmills on the side of the road by grand coulee dam.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/690_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/690_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/690_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 26, '2011-08-20 13:52:23'),
(691, 1, '210', 'Laser Light Show', 'The laser show projected on to grand coulee damn every night. It is free, you just show up in the parking lot, and then they play some Vangelis, John Michel JarrÃ© and talk about the force of water.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/691_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/691_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/691_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 13:55:15'),
(692, 1, '211', 'Square Mushroom Building', 'The visitor center for dry falls looks like a giant square mushroom.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/692_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/692_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/692_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 13:58:02'),
(693, 1, '211', 'Dry Falls', 'This was the largest waterfall in the world at the end of the last ice age. Now it is an awesome giant hole in the ground.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/693_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/693_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/693_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-20 13:59:23'),
(694, 1, '212', 'Teapot Dome Gas Station', 'Built by an entrepreneur who wished to capitalize on the Teapot Dome scandal because it was in the news all the time. I would guess that this is the only satyrical gas station in the world.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/694_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/694_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/694_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-20 14:03:07'),
(695, 1, '213', 'Volcano Bathroom', 'A bathroom designed to look like a volcano in dinosaur crazy granger washington.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/695_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/695_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/695_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-20 14:08:17'),
(696, 1, '213', 'Velociraptors', 'A pod of little green fellows in the dinosaur crazy granger washington. This was a park full of dinos but there were dino statues all over town.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/696_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/696_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/696_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 14:09:59'),
(697, 1, '214', 'Lavender Under Mt Hood', 'Man, this place smelled good. They give you a zip tie and a pair of scissors and tell you to pick as much as you can fit into the zip tie. Not a bad view either.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/697_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/697_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/697_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 14:18:18'),
(698, 1, '215', 'Strawberry Mt Hood', 'Pick your own strawberries under Mt Hood.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/698_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/698_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/698_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 14:23:50'),
(699, 1, '215', 'Strawbs!', 'A big batch of excellent berries. We were pretty excited about this after being in the midwest for quite sometime where good produce is sort of scarce.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/699_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/699_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/699_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 14:26:46'),
(700, 1, '216', 'Timberline Lodge Fireplace', 'This is my favorite interior of any park lodge. The details and furniture are amazing.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/700_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/700_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/700_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 39, '2011-08-20 14:29:58'),
(701, 1, '216', 'Timberline Lodge', 'The exterior of the Timberline lodge on Mt Hood. The exteriors were used as the Overlook Hotel in The Shining.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/701_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/701_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/701_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-20 14:34:07'),
(702, 1, '216', 'Only You Can Prevent Glacier Fires', 'A smoky the bear with skis has taken up permanent residence on top of basically a Glacier. Must get cold without a shirt.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/702_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/702_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/702_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-20 14:35:31'),
(703, 1, '217', 'The Vista House', 'A great drive and an amazing view of the Columbia River Gorge near Portland. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/703_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/703_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/703_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-20 14:38:51'),
(704, 1, '217', 'View From the VIsta House', 'Looking out over the Columbia Gorge from the incredible Vista House.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/704_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/704_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/704_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 14:39:55'),
(705, 1, '218', 'Charcoal Grilled Boar', 'Pok Pok was one of our favorite restaurants in Portland. The grilled boar was incredible as was everything else on their thai-ish menu. They also had a great selection of cocktails and drinks made with flavored vinegar.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/705_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/705_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/705_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 14:42:35'),
(706, 1, '219', 'Voodoo Doughnut', 'Fruitloop encrusted donuts and other assorted weirdoes at Voodoo Doughnut in Portland.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/706_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/706_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/706_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-20 14:44:57'),
(707, 1, '211', 'Dry Falls Lookout', 'The lookout over dry falls. A nice little platform that takes you out over the cliff edge.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/707_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/707_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/707_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-20 14:46:26'),
(708, 1, '220', 'Small part of Portland Record Haul', 'This was from Crossroads Records, a shop that has 35 different sellers with a bunch of different tastes.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/708_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/708_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/708_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-20 14:49:27'),
(709, 1, '221', 'Horsetail Falls', 'Along the Columbia River near portland there are many waterfalls. Horsetail was right next to our campground.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/709_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/709_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/709_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-20 14:53:56'),
(710, 1, '222', 'Multnomah Falls', 'The most famous of the waterfalls near portland, this is right as the sun was behind where the waterfall crests the hill.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/710_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/710_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/710_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 14:56:04'),
(711, 1, '223', 'Pipe Railing', 'A railing at the Kennedy School In Portland made from old bits of pipe fittings and faucets.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/711_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/711_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/711_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 17, '2011-08-20 14:58:17'),
(712, 1, '223', 'Detention Bar', 'The Kennedy School is an old elementary that has been converted to a pub, bar, brewery, hotel, theater, spa. My favorite of the many bars inside is the detention bar, a tiny room where the bad kids go to drink.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/712_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/712_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/712_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 15:00:12'),
(713, 1, '224', 'Waterfall', 'The Japanese Gardens in Portland are amazingly beautiful. We went on an overcast day and it was especially beautiful and muted feeling.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/713_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/713_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/713_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-20 15:03:28'),
(714, 1, '224', 'Walkway', 'A suspended walkway over a pond in the japanese gardens', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/714_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/714_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/714_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 14, '2011-08-20 15:04:44'),
(715, 1, '224', 'Stairs', 'A stone stairway at the japanese gardens in portland', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/715_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/715_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/715_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 15:05:25'),
(716, 1, '224', 'Bridge', 'A bridge over a pond in the japanese gardens in portland. It took a long time to wait for there to be no one in this shot.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/716_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/716_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/716_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 15:06:11'),
(717, 1, '225', 'The White Overalls', 'The cocktails at Beaker & Flask were all excellent. A must visit on a cocktail tour of portland.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/717_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/717_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/717_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 45, '2011-08-20 15:08:05'),
(718, 1, '226', 'Biwa Ramen', 'A superb Izakaya joint. Their yakatori and ramen were excellent. They had a fried kimchee that was awesome.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/718_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/718_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/718_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-20 15:10:02'),
(719, 1, '227', 'Artisanal Salt Shop', 'The James Beard award winning artisanal salt shop. Oh Portland... They also have an incredible selection of cocktail bitters here. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/719_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/719_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/719_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 15:12:41'),
(720, 1, '228', 'The Naked and Famous', 'Stopped in at Teardrop Lounge. The decor is terrible here (very cheesy 1990s style) but the drinks are excellent. Supposedly they are about to remodel so that should make this place a better hangout to match the quality of the drinks.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/720_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/720_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/720_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-20 15:15:41'),
(721, 1, '229', 'Welcome to Port Land!', 'The Portland sign over the Burnside St bridge. It looks better at night when it is all lit but but we just kept missing it at the right time.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/721_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/721_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/721_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 15:17:47'),
(722, 1, '230', 'Public Market', 'The sign above the market place on Pike St. Seattle does sunsets pretty well.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/722_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/722_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/722_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 15:20:15'),
(723, 1, '231', 'No Minors, No Firearms', 'The sign at the not too easy to find Bathtub Gin and Co in Seattle. It''s a great little speakeasy in an alleyway.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/723_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/723_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/723_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-20 15:22:48'),
(724, 1, '231', 'The Carnal Knowledge', 'One of our drinks at Bathtub Gin & Co.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/724_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/724_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/724_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 15:24:41'),
(725, 1, '232', 'The Gum Wall', 'A wall (really it is most of an alley) that is covered in hundreds of thousands of bits of spent gum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/725_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/725_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/725_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 15:27:06'),
(726, 1, '232', 'Gum Wall Detail', 'Close up of what a wall of gum looks like', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/726_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/726_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/726_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-20 15:27:47'),
(727, 1, '232', 'Gum Wall Waterfall', 'Gum streamers or gumsicles hanging from the window sill on the post alley gum wall in seattle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/727_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/727_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/727_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-20 15:28:46'),
(728, 1, '233', 'Salumi', 'Home of one of the best sandwiches I have ever had, the MolÃ© Salami sandwich. They have loads of great cured meats but the chocolaty, spicy molÃ© is impossible to beat.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/728_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/728_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/728_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-20 15:31:07'),
(729, 1, '233', 'MolÃ© Salami Sandwich', 'The excellent chocolaty, spicy, smoky molÃ© salami sandwich at Salumi in Seattle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/729_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/729_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/729_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 15:32:19'),
(730, 1, '234', 'Seattle Public Library', 'One of the most remarkable and striking buildings I have ever seen. The shapes are just intriguing and mindboggling. This was taken with a pano app on my phone so the lines of the building are a little curvier than in real life.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/730_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/730_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/730_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-20 15:34:42'),
(731, 1, '234', 'Dimensional', 'An exterior walkway at the Koolhaas designed Seattle Public Library.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/731_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/731_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/731_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-20 15:38:04'),
(732, 1, '235', 'Monorail!', 'Monorail in seattle is kinda awesome but also kinda useless. Glad they still have it though. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/732_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/732_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/732_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-20 15:40:11'),
(733, 1, '235', 'Next Stop... North Haverbrook!', 'The Monorail in Seattle on it''s way to the space needle.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/733_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/733_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/733_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-20 15:48:30'),
(734, 1, '235', 'Space Needle', 'One of the odder bits of architecture in the world. Doesn''t really serve any purpose other than looking cool.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/734_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/734_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/734_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 15:50:05'),
(735, 1, '235', 'Space Needle', 'Looking up at the space needle', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/735_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/735_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/735_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 15:50:43'),
(736, 1, '236', 'Old Fashioned With Iceberg', 'An expertly made Old Fashioned with an hand carved iceberg by Andrew Bohrer at Rob Roy.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/736_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/736_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/736_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-20 15:54:20'),
(737, 1, '237', 'This Is Art', 'The Trailer Park Mall in the Georgetown neighborhood of Seattle. We liked this area, cool buildings, record stores... seemed like a cool place.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/737_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/737_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/737_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 45, '2011-08-20 16:01:00'),
(738, 1, '238', 'Tree Sweaters', 'The Tree Sweaters are part of a public art project in Pioneer Square that wraps the trees with knitted covers.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/738_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/738_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/738_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 146, '2011-08-20 16:28:04'),
(739, 1, '239', 'Concorde', 'The nose of the Concorde at the Museum of Flight on a very rainy day.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/739_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/739_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/739_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-20 16:30:21'),
(740, 1, '239', 'Concorde', 'Great to get a chance to see a concorde and walk through it. It is tiny inside.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/740_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/740_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/740_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 16:33:19'),
(741, 1, '239', 'Concorde Intakes', 'The air intake on one side of the concorde. They are actually a pretty clever solution. Air can''t enter a jet engine at supersonic speeds as it would wreck the engine, so the intake has a bunch of variable geometry fins inside that shape the air and slow it down from mach 2 to mach 0.5 before it gets to the engines.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/741_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/741_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/741_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 16:45:38'),
(742, 1, '239', 'M-21 Blackbird', 'Another of the many Blackbirds we saw on this trip. This one is a called an M-21 rather than an SR71 because it is configured to be the in air launch platform for a D-21 camera drone that you can see fitted on it''s back. M-21 for Mother D-21 for Daughter.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/742_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/742_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/742_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-20 16:47:50'),
(743, 1, '239', 'Boeing 314 Clipper Ship Anchor', 'Sadly there are no clipper ships left in the world. The airplane that made Pan Am''s famous round the world service work is gone, but this is what the anchor looked like.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/743_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/743_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/743_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 16:49:27'),
(744, 1, '240', 'Logjammin', 'A fallen log in the hall of mosses in Olympic National Park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/744_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/744_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/744_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-20 16:54:28'),
(745, 1, '240', 'The Hall of Mosses', 'A very mossy area in the Hoh Rain Forest. On an average year this place gets 13 feet of rain. The Hall of Mosses is a beautiful trail though a forest that has largely been taken over by moss.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/745_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/745_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/745_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-20 16:57:33'),
(746, 1, '241', 'First Beach', 'Looking north from first beach towards several rocky islands in the pacific.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/746_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/746_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/746_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-20 17:01:21'),
(747, 1, '242', 'Trail to Third Beach', 'Trail through a rainforest out to a beautiful beach.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/747_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/747_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/747_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-20 17:35:28'),
(748, 1, '242', 'Third Beach', 'The end of the trail to third beach is covered with thousands of logs that have washed ashore. You have to clamber over them all to get to the beach with is incredible. You can see the awesome sea stacks off in the distance.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/748_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/748_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/748_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-20 17:37:41'),
(749, 1, '241', 'Roots', 'A giant (15 foot tall) root structure from a spruce tree that has washed up on the beach at our campground.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/749_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/749_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/749_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-08-20 17:39:51'),
(750, 1, '243', 'Twin Island', 'One of the sea stacks, which are just eroded bits of rocks, on Rialto Beach.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/750_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/750_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/750_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 17:42:25'),
(751, 1, '244', 'Vampire Threat Level', 'A sign indicating the danger of vampires in forks washington. This is less random than it looks because forks is where the stupid twilight books were based so everything is twilight themed.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/751_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/751_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/751_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 86, '2011-08-20 17:46:08'),
(752, 1, '245', 'Cape Flattery', 'Named for the explorers who flattered themselves thinking they had found the northwest passage (it was just the straight of Juan de Fuca), Cape Flattery is a stunning bit of coast line and the northwestern-most bit of land in the continental US', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/752_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/752_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/752_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 20, '2011-08-20 17:49:33'),
(753, 1, '245', 'Cape Flattery', 'Named for the explorers who flattered themselves thinking they had found the northwest passage (it was just the straight of Juan de Fuca), Cape Flattery is a stunning bit of coast line and the northwestern-most bit of land in the continental US', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/753_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/753_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/753_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-20 17:55:23'),
(754, 1, '245', 'Trail to Cape Flattery', 'This little park is exceptional. It is run by the indian tribe so rather than being all safe and wheel chair accessible they have this fantastic rickety spruce trail that leads out to the coast. Along the way it meanders past this crazy octopus tree.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/754_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/754_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/754_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-20 17:57:18'),
(755, 1, '246', 'Olympic Deer', 'The deer in Olympic National Park are pretty damn tame. This one was just hanging out on the path.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/755_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/755_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/755_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 18:01:17'),
(756, 1, '246', 'Hurricane Ridge', 'Olympic is a crazy park, beaches, rainforests and glaciers. This is up in the mountains and glaciers. It is a beautiful drive getting up here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/756_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/756_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/756_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-20 18:03:07'),
(757, 1, '247', 'The Wreck of the Peter Iredale', 'The rotting remains of a sailing ship that was beached in 1906.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/757_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/757_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/757_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 18:05:40'),
(758, 1, '247', 'Wreck of the Peter Iredale', 'The remains of a beached sailing ship on the beach near astoria.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/758_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/758_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/758_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-20 18:07:15'),
(759, 1, '248', 'Astoria Column', 'A column built in the name of John Jacob Astor, the fur trapper and aristocrat breeder. It was super foggy and rainy this day but the view from the top was still incredible.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/759_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/759_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/759_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 23, '2011-08-20 18:10:41'),
(760, 1, '249', 'Goonies Jail Cell', 'The jail cell from the beginning of the goonies movie where one of the fratelli brothers pretends to hang himself.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/760_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/760_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/760_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 17, '2011-08-20 18:13:15'),
(761, 1, '250', 'Fort George Brewery', 'A good place to grab a beer while wandering around astoria. The sausage sampler was great too.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/761_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/761_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/761_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 25, '2011-08-20 18:15:17'),
(762, 1, '251', 'Mikey''s House From The Goonies', 'The house that the goonies were all trying to save in the movie. Ironically it was recently purchased in a foreclosure sale. I wonder if they paid in rubies and other rich stuff.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/762_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/762_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/762_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 50, '2011-08-20 18:17:57'),
(763, 1, '252', 'Cheese Factory', 'The Tilamook Cheese Factory. If you like cheese and Ice Cream, then this is a great tour. You get to see how they make it, cut it and package it. Plus you get free cheese!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/763_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/763_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/763_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-20 18:21:49'),
(764, 1, '253', 'Octopus Tree', 'A tree that has split into many bits of trees and is now 45 feet in diameter. They don''t really know why this tree has grown this way, possibly struck by lightning, or something that the natives did.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/764_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/764_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/764_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-20 18:26:44'),
(765, 1, '253', 'Cape Meares Lighthouse', 'One of the many lighthouses along the Oregon coast. This one is particularly pretty, and when we got there there were hundreds of Puffins in the water below.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/765_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/765_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/765_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-20 18:28:57'),
(766, 1, '254', 'The Spruce Goose', 'Hard to communicate in photos how big this plane really is but it has a wingspan that is over 100 feet more than a 747. There were probably 20 planes underneath it at this museum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/766_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/766_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/766_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-20 18:35:35'),
(767, 1, '254', 'Evergreen SR71', 'The Blackbird on display in McMinnville. This one has the engine nacelle open for engine servicing which is a nice way to show it off.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/767_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/767_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/767_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-20 18:37:33'),
(768, 1, '255', '747 Waterpark', 'This is a full size 747 parked on the roof of a water park with a bunch of waterslides coming out of it. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/768_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/768_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/768_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 27, '2011-08-20 18:41:25'),
(769, 1, '256', 'Edgefield Distillery Sampler', 'Got a selection of spirits made at their edgefield distillery. The Alambic brandy was superb.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/769_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/769_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/769_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 28, '2011-08-20 18:44:55'),
(770, 1, '257', 'Tillamook Air Museum', 'The Mini Guppy outside of the worlds largest wooden building, an old military blimp hangar.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/770_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/770_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/770_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 43, '2011-08-20 18:47:02'),
(771, 1, '257', 'Inside the Hangar', 'This is the worlds largest wooden building. 1072 feet long 192 feet tall and 290 feet wide. The floor inside is 7 and a half acres. a tiny fraction of it houses the awesome little air museum.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/771_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/771_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/771_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-20 18:50:33'),
(772, 1, '257', 'The Blimp Hangar', 'The giant former blimp hangar that was the Tillamook Naval Air Station is now the Tillamook Air Museum, the largest wooden building in the world with a floor that is over 7 acres.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/772_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/772_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/772_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-20 18:52:27'),
(773, 1, '258', 'Darlingtonia Bog', 'The Darlingtonia, or Cobra Lilly, Is a carnivorous plant that only grows in northern California and southern Oregon. This is a bog of them that is right off the side of the road.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/773_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/773_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/773_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-20 18:55:53'),
(774, 1, '258', 'Darlingtonia Bog', 'The Darlingtonia, or Cobra Lilly, Is a carnivorous plant that only grows in northern California and southern Oregon. This is a bog of them that is right off the side of the road.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/774_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/774_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/774_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 60, '2011-08-20 18:57:39');
INSERT INTO `photos` (`id`, `user_id`, `place_id`, `title`, `caption`, `url`, `thumbnail`, `med`, `width`, `height`, `active`, `views`, `created`) VALUES
(775, 1, '259', 'Oregon Dunes', 'Walking out on the Dellenback trail through the Oregon Dunes seeing dunes forming in the wind.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/775_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/775_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/775_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-20 19:06:43'),
(776, 1, '259', 'Dune Formation', 'The Oregon Dunes being formed by the wind as we walked by.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/776_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/776_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/776_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-20 19:07:47'),
(777, 1, '259', 'Dune Entropy', 'Part of the oregon dunes subsiding.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/777_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/777_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/777_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-20 19:08:34'),
(778, 1, '260', 'Pokey Coastline', 'The coastline near the cape blanco lighthouse. We camped out here for a few days before coming back in to california because it was pretty and Oregon state parks are infinitely better than california''s', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/778_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/778_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/778_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 19, '2011-08-20 19:10:36'),
(779, 1, '260', 'Curvey Tree', 'An unusual formation in a tree along the trail to the beach.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/779_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/779_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/779_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 19, '2011-08-20 19:11:32'),
(780, 1, '260', 'Hidin Out in the Woods', 'Our campsite at Cape Blanco. Not a bad place to spend a few days.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/780_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/780_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/780_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 43, '2011-08-20 19:12:27'),
(781, 1, '261', 'Oregon Coastline', 'Getting close to California for the first time in 9 months!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/781_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/781_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/781_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 34, '2011-08-20 19:16:34'),
(782, 1, '262', 'T-Rex Attack!', 'T-Rex and an Apatosaurus at Prehistoric Gardens, an awesome collection of plaster dinosaurs in the forest off of hwy 101.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/782_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/782_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/782_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-21 10:23:07'),
(783, 1, '262', 'Flashy Little Fellow', 'Some kind of flamboyant lizard at Prehistoric Gardens.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/783_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/783_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/783_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 18, '2011-08-21 10:24:08'),
(784, 1, '262', 'Oh Hai!', 'Comedy dino poking up through the ferns at Prehistoric Gardens.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/784_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/784_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/784_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 30, '2011-08-21 10:24:55'),
(785, 1, '262', 'Pterry!', 'A Pterodactyl taking flight at Prehistoric Gardens.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/785_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/785_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/785_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 21, '2011-08-21 10:25:53'),
(786, 1, '263', 'Oregon Caves Chateau', 'A nice little lodge that straddles the river that comes out of the mouth of the cave.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/786_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/786_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/786_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 40, '2011-08-21 10:58:56'),
(787, 1, '264', 'Welcome Home', 'Coming Back to California for the first time in 9 months. A welcome sight.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/787_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/787_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/787_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-21 11:03:11'),
(788, 1, '263', 'Drapery At Oregon Caves', 'Formations called drapery inside of Oregon Caves. This cave is strange because it is carved from marble.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/788_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/788_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/788_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-21 11:05:48'),
(789, 1, '263', 'Stalactites', 'A waterfall of stalactites in Oregon Caves. Many of them were broken off by tourists before the park service took over.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/789_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/789_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/789_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-21 11:08:34'),
(790, 1, '263', 'Bark', 'The entire outside of the Oregon Caves Chateau is covered in furry bark.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/790_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/790_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/790_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-21 11:10:18'),
(791, 1, '265', 'Babe The Big Blue Ox', 'Paul Bunyan and Babe hanging out at Trees of Mystery.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/791_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/791_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/791_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 49, '2011-08-21 11:12:59'),
(792, 1, '265', 'Paul Bunyan and Babe', 'A giant Paul Bunyan and Babe the Big Blue Ox hang out in front of Trees of Mystery in the redwoods. Paul talks to the audience most days and his hand sometimes waves at people.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/792_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/792_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/792_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 31, '2011-08-21 11:14:29'),
(793, 1, '266', 'Lost at Sea Memorial', 'The Memorial Lighthouse has an area for those lost at sea.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/793_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/793_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/793_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 42, '2011-08-21 11:16:51'),
(794, 1, '266', 'Trinidad Lighthouse', 'The Memorial Lighthouse in Trinidad is a copy of the actual lighthouse that protected the rocky cove of trinidad. It was built as a memorial to those lost or buried at sea.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/794_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/794_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/794_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 36, '2011-08-21 11:18:32'),
(795, 1, '267', 'Carson Mansion', 'One of the most remarkable buildings we have seen, the victorian freakout built by a lumber baron called the Carson Mansion. It is now the Ingomar Club, whose mission as far as i can work out is to hang out in the house and keep it from falling down.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/795_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/795_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/795_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 22, '2011-08-21 11:23:37'),
(796, 1, '267', 'The Carson Mansion', 'One of the most remarkable buildings we have seen, the victorian freakout built by a lumber baron called the Carson Mansion. It is now the Ingomar Club, whose mission as far as i can work out is to hang out in the house and keep it from falling down.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/796_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/796_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/796_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 29, '2011-08-21 11:25:51'),
(797, 1, '268', 'Log RV', 'An RV made from a hollowed out redwood log.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/797_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/797_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/797_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-21 11:29:00'),
(798, 1, '269', 'The Travel Log', 'Another RV made from a hollowed out redwood tree. This one was pretty well appointed. It hangs out inside the visitor center at Humboldt Redwoods State Park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/798_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/798_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/798_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-21 11:33:54'),
(799, 1, '270', 'The Eternal Treehouse', 'This used to be the gift shop but it looked pretty leaky. Now it is just an awesome little treehouse.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/799_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/799_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/799_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-21 11:38:22'),
(800, 1, '271', 'The Drive Thru Tree', 'The Shine Drive Thru Tree. This tree has long been dead and is now held together with metal cables, but it is one of only a few drive through trees left. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/800_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/800_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/800_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-21 11:40:51'),
(801, 1, '271', 'Cathedral Tree', 'A stand of trees that has grown out of one stump that creates a sort of tower effect. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/801_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/801_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/801_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-21 11:42:05'),
(802, 1, '272', 'The Chandelier Tree', 'The best of the drive-through trees. This one was still alive and surprisingly healthy.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/802_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/802_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/802_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-21 11:44:00'),
(803, 1, '273', 'One Log House', 'A house carved from a giant redwood log. Inside are all the basic amenities. It is sort of like an early mobile home. The original single wide.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/803_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/803_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/803_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 41, '2011-08-21 11:51:12'),
(804, 1, '270', 'Avenue of the Giants', 'It really is a great drive, through the trees here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/804_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/804_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/804_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 24, '2011-08-21 11:55:12'),
(805, 1, '274', 'Welcome To WIllits', 'The gateway to the redwoods. Willits has a pretty good welcome to town sign.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/805_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/805_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/805_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 32, '2011-08-21 12:02:57'),
(806, 1, '275', 'Brandy Tasting', 'Running through the Cognac and Calvados style brandies at Germain-Robin in Ukiah. These guys make some of the best brandies i have ever had.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/806_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/806_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/806_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 79, '2011-08-21 12:05:38'),
(807, 1, '276', 'Spoonbar', 'Scott Beattie''s excellent Spoonbar in Healdsburg. This is the Smoky Paloma and the Exit 503', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/807_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/807_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/807_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 47, '2011-08-21 12:08:31'),
(808, 1, '276', 'Cocktail Garden', 'Scott Beattie in action behind his extraordinary herb garden on the bar at Spoonbar', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/808_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/808_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/808_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 35, '2011-08-21 12:09:43'),
(809, 1, '277', 'Fremont Diner Menu', 'The best southern food that we have had since the south and maybe the best overall.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/809_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/809_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/809_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 44, '2011-08-21 12:12:00'),
(810, 1, '277', 'Take That Arteries!', 'Exceptional southern breakfast at the fremont diner. Chicken fried pork chops with smoked ham, sausage gravy, and a fried egg with biscuits. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/810_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/810_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/810_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 37, '2011-08-21 12:14:12'),
(811, 1, '278', 'The World Famous Tree House!', 'Believe it or not!', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/811_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/811_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/811_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 68, '2011-08-21 12:16:41'),
(812, 1, '279', 'The Glory of Arm Wrestling', 'There used to be a wrist wrestling competition in Petaluma and this is the statue that commemorates it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/812_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/812_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/812_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 55, '2011-08-21 12:19:18'),
(813, 1, '279', 'Wrist Wrestling Statue', 'The statue in Petaluma commemorating the annual wrist wrestling championship.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/813_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/813_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/813_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 38, '2011-08-21 12:20:29'),
(814, 1, '280', 'Chemex at Sightglass', 'No better way to make coffee in my opinion. And Sightglass as an awesome cavernous space.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/814_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/814_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/814_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 43, '2011-08-21 12:22:54'),
(815, 1, '281', 'Swiftcurrent Lake', 'Many Glacier Lodge at Swiftcurrent Lake in the northeastern part of Glacier. The lodge here is a great place to hang out though it is pretty far out in the middle of nowhere, especially for us since the going-to-the-sun road was closed and we had to drive the long way around.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/815_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/815_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/815_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 41, '2011-08-21 13:53:07'),
(816, 1, '206', 'Wild Goose Lake at Sunset', 'This might well be the most photographed part of Glacier, but you can kinda see why.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/816_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/816_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/816_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-08-21 13:55:11'),
(817, 1, '206', 'Wild Goose Island', 'A tiny little island in the middle of St Mary''s Lake in Glacier National Park', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/817_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/817_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/817_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 44, '2011-08-21 13:56:48'),
(818, 1, '206', 'WIld Goose Island', 'St Mary Lake at sunset', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/818_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/818_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/818_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 62, '2011-08-21 13:57:47'),
(819, 1, '281', 'Many Glacier Lodge', 'The Lodge at Many Glacier is a huge room, and like all of the lodges in Glacier, made mostly from logs. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/819_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/819_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/819_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1536', 1, 76, '2011-08-21 14:00:03'),
(820, 1, '281', 'Many Glacier Lodge', 'All of the lodges at Glacier are swiss chalet styled. And then there are mountains that look like the alps in the background.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/820_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/820_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/820_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 100, '2011-08-21 14:01:36'),
(821, 1, '205', 'Boat Dock', 'The dock that the tours of lake McDonald leave from.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/821_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/821_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/821_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 70, '2011-08-21 14:08:16'),
(822, 1, '205', 'Lake McDonald Lodge', 'This was a great little lodge, with an awesome chandelier made by a local indian tribe. The fireplace here was a particularly nice place to sit.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/822_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/822_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/822_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 98, '2011-08-21 14:10:09'),
(823, 1, '205', 'Lake McDonald Lodge', 'The fireplace at Lake McDonald Lodge. It was recessed into the wall with benches and was quite a nice little space to hang out.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/823_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/823_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/823_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 71, '2011-08-21 14:11:34'),
(824, 1, '205', 'Lake McDonald Lodge', 'The outside of the lodge and one of the ubiquitous open top tour buses that run throughout the park.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/824_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/824_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/824_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 71, '2011-08-21 14:13:04'),
(825, 1, '204', 'Glacier Park Lodge', 'The biggest of the lodges, this is actually just outside the park in East Glacier. The interior is made from giant trees with the bark still on them.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/825_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/825_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/825_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 51, '2011-08-21 14:14:52'),
(826, 1, '204', 'Glacier Park Lodge', 'The lobby of the main lodge at Glacier. These logs that act as the support columns were still covered in bark. Not sure how they have kept it from falling off after all of these years.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/826_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/826_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/826_1_600.jpg', '1024', '1024', 1, 119, '2011-08-21 14:16:48'),
(827, 1, '283', 'Coit Tower', 'The self explanatory sign for coit tower.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/827_1_612.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/827_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/827_1_600.jpg', '612', '612', 1, 33, '2011-09-12 16:02:51'),
(828, 2, '142', 'Georgia Dogwood', 'These were everywhere this spring. I wonder if they will grow on the west coast, because they sure are pretty.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/828_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/828_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/828_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 38, '2011-09-12 18:27:15'),
(829, 2, '142', 'Spring Forest', 'Green! ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/829_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/829_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/829_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 25, '2011-09-12 19:22:28'),
(830, 2, '142', 'Church', 'They had a lot of building that they''d saved by moving them to the museum, but no town would part with their church, so they built one. You can even ring the bell.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/830_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/830_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/830_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 36, '2011-09-12 19:24:07'),
(831, 2, '142', 'Church', 'They had a lot of buildings that they''d saved by moving them to the museum, but no town would part with their church, so they built one. You can even ring the bell.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/831_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/831_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/831_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 26, '2011-09-12 19:24:20'),
(832, 2, '142', 'Foxfire Museum', 'The piece of land that Foxfire purchased sure is pretty.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/832_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/832_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/832_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 42, '2011-09-12 19:29:07'),
(833, 2, '143', 'Old Mill', 'Turns out it''s nearly impossible to take a bad photo of an old mill.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/833_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/833_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/833_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 37, '2011-09-12 19:36:02'),
(834, 2, '143', 'Your rights', 'Odd place for this sign, on top of the Appalachian Trail.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/834_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/834_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/834_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1365', 1, 30, '2011-09-12 19:40:32'),
(835, 2, '143', 'Long Walk', 'One day when I don''t have a forbidden dog with me, I''m going to walk a bit of this.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/835_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/835_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/835_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 41, '2011-09-12 19:44:34'),
(836, 2, '143', 'State(s) Line', 'A well documented sign by all driving past. Especially because it was foggy, and you couldn''t see much.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/836_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/836_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/836_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 41, '2011-09-12 19:46:11'),
(837, 2, '143', 'No nuts', 'Clearly people were ignoring the sign, as the wildlife seemed totally unafraid of humans.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/837_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/837_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/837_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 27, '2011-09-12 19:48:23'),
(838, 2, '122', 'Avoid', 'We drove 20,000 miles in a 30 year old RV, and we didn''t have this happen. Amazing.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/838_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/838_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/838_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 63, '2011-09-12 19:51:17'),
(839, 2, '122', 'Snatcher', 'Apparently towing vehicles have names that are just as silly as diesel engines.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/839_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/839_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/839_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 52, '2011-09-12 19:53:45'),
(840, 2, '122', 'Certified', 'More towing signage.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/840_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/840_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/840_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 26, '2011-09-12 19:58:50'),
(841, 2, '284', 'Choo Choo', 'The Chattanooga Choo-Choo, of course.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/841_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/841_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/841_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 38, '2011-09-12 20:02:41'),
(842, 2, '32', 'Treehouse', '7 trees, 100 feet tall, and at least one floorboard that says "do not stand here" written on it.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/842_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/842_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/842_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 58, '2011-09-12 20:49:16'),
(843, 2, '32', 'Treehouse detail', 'Appropriate for easter sunday.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/843_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/843_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/843_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 58, '2011-09-12 20:51:16'),
(844, 2, '32', 'View to the bird''s nest', 'I think you could actually go up there, but I wouldn''t want to.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/844_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/844_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/844_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 60, '2011-09-12 20:53:40'),
(845, 2, '32', 'Rules', 'No fun zone.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/845_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/845_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/845_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 87, '2011-09-12 21:04:33'),
(846, 2, '129', 'The Lisa Marie', 'One of Elvis Presley''s jets.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/846_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/846_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/846_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 96, '2011-09-12 21:17:41'),
(847, 2, '285', 'No man''s land marker', 'A marker for the mass grave where hundreds of victims of the yellow fever outbreak of 1878 are buried.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/847_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/847_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/847_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 92, '2011-09-12 21:22:24'),
(848, 2, '285', 'Hope', 'At the beautiful Elmwood Cemetery in Memphis, Tennessee. One of the first park-like rural cemeteries of the South.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/848_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/848_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/848_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 103, '2011-09-12 21:24:44'),
(849, 2, '285', 'Well dressed ', 'I wonder if these were as creepy to Victorian''s?', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/849_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/849_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/849_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 100, '2011-09-12 21:27:56'),
(850, 2, '148', 'Stax', 'The newly rebuilt Stax museum. Until a few years ago it was just the sign, they knocked the building down in the 1980''s.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/850_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/850_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/850_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 96, '2011-09-12 21:30:15'),
(851, 2, '286', 'The Pyramid', 'The 6th largest in the world! And soon to be a Bass Pro Shop. No really.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/851_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/851_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/851_2_600.jpg', '1024', '768', 1, 117, '2011-09-12 21:34:38'),
(852, 2, '129', 'Graceland Graffiti', 'Not a single bit of wall is left without writing. And there are apparently lots of fans from Ireland. ', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/852_2_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/852_2_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/852_2_600.jpg', '1024', '1001', 1, 79, '2011-09-12 21:38:50'),
(853, 1, '86', 'Ft Sumter', 'This is where the first shots of the civil were fired. As seen from the boat coming into the island.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/853_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/853_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/853_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 48, '2011-10-13 14:56:48'),
(854, 1, '86', 'Castle Pinckney', 'Another of the forts in charleston bay.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/854_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/854_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/854_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 49, '2011-10-13 15:05:02'),
(855, 1, '86', 'Charleston Skyline', 'Charleston is sometimes called the "Holy City" since the skyline is so full of churches. This is shot from the ferry out to Ft. Sumter.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/855_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/855_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/855_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 52, '2011-10-13 15:06:27'),
(856, 1, '86', 'The Arthur Ravenel Jr. Bridge', 'We found this to be a style quite popular throughout the south. This guy is relatively new to Charleston, from 2005.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/856_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/856_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/856_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-10-13 15:08:58'),
(857, 1, '86', 'Ft Sumter Northern Battery', 'This battery was completely covered by rubble and then further buried when they built the new fort on top of the old one. When the park service took over they dug this out and cleaned up the old canons.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/857_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/857_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/857_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 43, '2011-10-13 15:10:30'),
(858, 1, '86', 'Canon Batteries', 'Another view of the northern battery that was completely covered over when they built the new fort. Only after the park service took it over did they try and restore the original remains.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/858_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/858_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/858_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 55, '2011-10-13 15:11:48'),
(859, 1, '86', 'Battery Huger', 'After the war a new blockhouse style fortification was built on top of the old fort called Battery Huger. Painted black it looks really out of place here.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/859_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/859_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/859_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 84, '2011-10-13 15:15:55'),
(860, 1, '86', 'Western Canon', 'One of the canons facing west right near the main entrance.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/860_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/860_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/860_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 62, '2011-10-13 15:16:39'),
(861, 1, '86', 'Ft Sumter at the End of the War', 'This park service photo from what the fort looked like at the end of the war.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/861_1_1024.jpeg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/861_1_200c.jpeg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/861_1_600.jpeg', '1024', '412', 1, 66, '2011-10-13 15:17:35'),
(862, 1, '195', '12 Foot Tall Concrete Prairie Dog', 'A little battered, but this guy hangs out on the side of the road to a feed your own prairie dog town near the badlands.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/862_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/862_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/862_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 225, '2011-10-18 13:40:49'),
(863, 1, '195', 'On Patrol', 'Two Prairie Dogs, one sleeping one on patrol.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/863_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/863_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/863_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 120, '2011-10-18 13:43:05'),
(864, 1, '195', 'Prairie Dogs', 'These guys let me get pretty close... in fact i think i could have pet them if i wanted plague.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/864_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/864_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/864_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 159, '2011-10-18 13:44:37'),
(865, 1, '195', 'Flatler', 'This prairie dog was sunning himself and could get pretty flat to absorb the most amount of sun.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/865_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/865_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/865_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 199, '2011-10-18 13:45:56'),
(866, 1, '195', 'Prairie Dog Town', 'Two watchful little guys keeping an eye out for hawks... or peanuts.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/866_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/866_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/866_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 132, '2011-10-18 13:48:51'),
(867, 1, '195', 'Kissin Cousins', 'The prairie dog kiss. you see this all day long here. Get a room guys.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/867_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/867_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/867_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 132, '2011-10-18 13:50:14'),
(868, 1, '195', 'Alana Entices a Prairie Dog', 'You can buy a back of peanuts for 50 cents and then the prairie dogs kind of care about you.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/868_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/868_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/868_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 158, '2011-10-18 13:54:11'),
(869, 1, '195', 'Nibbler', 'Here''s a prairie dog very rapidly removing a peanut from it''s shell. They are all pretty muddy from digging all day presumably.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/869_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/869_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/869_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 110, '2011-10-18 13:55:38'),
(870, 1, '195', 'Muddy Buddy`', 'A nut eating dirty prairie dog. sounds like a sort of crappy 18th century insult.', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/870_1_1024.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/870_1_200c.jpg', 'http://50states.s3.amazonaws.com/870_1_600.jpg', '1024', '683', 1, 210, '2011-10-18 13:56:39');
